(5894802, 858914, 100335, '<td valign="top">The perspective is interesting. took me a second to get what it is. At first i thought it was some kind of wall with a train going through it. Its got some dark areas here and there. I think i would have liked this more without the white building on the right side and the gray structure on the left for the sake of symmetry. So bottom line, i like, but wished there was more even lighting and symmetry.</td>', 'The perspective is interesting. took me a second to get what it is. At first i thought it was some kind of wall with a train going through it. Its got some dark areas here and there. I think i would have liked this more without the white building on the right side and the gray structure on the left for the sake of symmetry. So bottom line, i like, but wished there was more even lighting and symmetry.', '2010-03-08 12:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
