(5894953, 859023, 68956, '<td valign="top">In a challenge where there were many images to enjoy, I think this is one that I''ve enjoyed most :)</td>', 'In a challenge where there were many images to enjoy, I think this is one that I''ve enjoyed most :)', '2010-03-08 13:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894962, 858137, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, especially the processing.  "Always and Forever" would have been a fitting title also.</td>', 'Nicely done, especially the processing.  "Always and Forever" would have been a fitting title also.', '2010-03-08 13:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894964, 858694, 66515, '<td valign="top">great abstract image. I love the colors and the composition</td>', 'great abstract image. I love the colors and the composition', '2010-03-08 13:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894969, 858959, 39184, '<td valign="top">The unlevel horizon, the far right end of the sculpture terminating on the horizon, and most especially the filthy sensor and/or lens really hurt the score on this entry.</td>', 'The unlevel horizon, the far right end of the sculpture terminating on the horizon, and most especially the filthy sensor and/or lens really hurt the score on this entry.', '2010-03-08 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894972, 859176, 28427, '<td valign="top">Original approach and very well executed.  Somehow I really don''t want to know what''s the drip coming out of the flower :D</td>', 'Original approach and very well executed.  Somehow I really don''t want to know what''s the drip coming out of the flower :D', '2010-03-08 14:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894975, 859118, 39184, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the choice to go with the purple duotone processing.  There also appears to be a lot of haloing as a result of heavy post processing around the wing on the left and ghosting, especially around the foliage and stems on the bottom of the image.  On a positive note, you did a great job catching this bird in flight while maintaining a lot of sharp detail.</td>', 'I don''t care for the choice to go with the purple duotone processing.  There also appears to be a lot of haloing as a result of heavy post processing around the wing on the left and ghosting, especially around the foliage and stems on the bottom of the image.  On a positive note, you did a great job catching this bird in flight while maintaining a lot of sharp detail.', '2010-03-08 14:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894977, 857856, 39184, '<td valign="top">I think that this needs to be explained a little bit more.  Sorry for the sarcasm, but I really don''t like to be told what to think by the title.  While titles often add a lot to the art, I think that the image should mostly speak for itself.</td>', 'I think that this needs to be explained a little bit more.  Sorry for the sarcasm, but I really don''t like to be told what to think by the title.  While titles often add a lot to the art, I think that the image should mostly speak for itself.', '2010-03-08 14:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894981, 858932, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not bad. I like the composition and the leaf(?), bird(?), moth(?). I like that its colouring stands out. The colour on the boy seems uneven, though, his left arm is more orange than the rest of him. The grain might be a bit overdone but overall I like the sepia tone.</td>', 'Not bad. I like the composition and the leaf(?), bird(?), moth(?). I like that its colouring stands out. The colour on the boy seems uneven, though, his left arm is more orange than the rest of him. The grain might be a bit overdone but overall I like the sepia tone.', '2010-03-08 14:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894983, 858600, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the birds, really nice. This might be just as good without the person in the background.</td>', 'Love the birds, really nice. This might be just as good without the person in the background.', '2010-03-08 14:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894984, 858551, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good title. Even though this is just a photo of tracks in the mud there''s something compelling about it.</td>', 'Good title. Even though this is just a photo of tracks in the mud there''s something compelling about it.', '2010-03-08 14:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894985, 858913, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very surreal, good job.</td>', 'Very surreal, good job.', '2010-03-08 14:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5894987, 858945, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good photo, I like the composition.</td>', 'Good photo, I like the composition.', '2010-03-08 14:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
