(5895021, 859159, 100335, '<td valign="top">This photo made me turn my laptop towards my wife and say "oooh look at this one!" she grumbled something along the lines of "meh" but what does she know!! i totally love it. 9</td>', 'This photo made me turn my laptop towards my wife and say "oooh look at this one!" she grumbled something along the lines of "meh" but what does she know!! i totally love it. 9', '2010-03-08 14:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895022, 858525, 100335, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I have no idea what it is!! but i love it!! very nicely processed too. Good luck.</td>', 'Very cool! I have no idea what it is!! but i love it!! very nicely processed too. Good luck.', '2010-03-08 14:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895023, 859248, 100335, '<td valign="top">loving the concept i just wish something was a little in focus. But thats just my opinion you may have intended it this way. This Reminds me of something i''d see at an art exhibition. I love your choice of clothing its very interesting and i love that i cant exactly make out what he''s wearing. 7</td>', 'loving the concept i just wish something was a little in focus. But thats just my opinion you may have intended it this way. This Reminds me of something i''d see at an art exhibition. I love your choice of clothing its very interesting and i love that i cant exactly make out what he''s wearing. 7', '2010-03-08 14:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895024, 858694, 100335, '<td valign="top">This is so cool! i am really loving voting on this challenge so far i am liking everything i see. This is very nice but theres a "but" unfortunately :P <br/>I''m not to keen on the narrow vertical nature of the shot. But thats just me, still a nice piece of art. I def would have scored you higher with a wider and less vertical image.</td>', 'This is so cool! i am really loving voting on this challenge so far i am liking everything i see. This is very nice but theres a "but" unfortunately :P I''m not to keen on the narrow vertical nature of the shot. But thats just me, still a nice piece of art. I def would have scored you higher with a wider and less vertical image.', '2010-03-08 14:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895035, 859122, 52336, '<td valign="top">Effectively creepy and nicely presented.  Thanks.</td>', 'Effectively creepy and nicely presented.  Thanks.', '2010-03-08 14:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
