(5895797, 859189, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and light. Not sure about the exposure, or perhaps the b&amp;w conversion. It seems too gray.</td>', 'I like the composition and light. Not sure about the exposure, or perhaps the b&w conversion. It seems too gray.', '2010-03-08 23:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895824, 859213, 5112, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is the idea that you were working with, but I like to see this rather classic still life presented in a very "today" way.  Good work.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is the idea that you were working with, but I like to see this rather classic still life presented in a very "today" way.  Good work.', '2010-03-08 23:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895826, 858551, 52336, '<td valign="top">I like this for the personal connection it has for me: I love to hike, and this is a familiar sight on some of my trails.  Well presented and nicely executed.  Thanks.</td>', 'I like this for the personal connection it has for me: I love to hike, and this is a familiar sight on some of my trails.  Well presented and nicely executed.  Thanks.', '2010-03-08 23:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895827, 857780, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, moody, nicely done.  But, I think the heavy border takes away from the lightness and mood of the image.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, moody, nicely done.  But, I think the heavy border takes away from the lightness and mood of the image.', '2010-03-08 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895828, 859027, 5112, '<td valign="top">A gutsy image, maybe framed (or cropped) just a little too close for comfort, but with a very contemporary message presented with great honesty.  I like it.</td>', 'A gutsy image, maybe framed (or cropped) just a little too close for comfort, but with a very contemporary message presented with great honesty.  I like it.', '2010-03-08 23:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895831, 858897, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like that this is an honest portrait.  I don''t much like the skin treatment, it seems a bit too plastic.  I like her expression, and her direct way of looking at the camera, but I find that the background doesn''t frame her, doesn''t add much.  Also, the processing is a bit on the strong side overall.  Honest portraits are rare and good.</td>', 'I like that this is an honest portrait.  I don''t much like the skin treatment, it seems a bit too plastic.  I like her expression, and her direct way of looking at the camera, but I find that the background doesn''t frame her, doesn''t add much.  Also, the processing is a bit on the strong side overall.  Honest portraits are rare and good.', '2010-03-08 23:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895832, 858917, 5112, '<td valign="top">I wish this were in the running!  It is, I think, my favourite entry overall.  It''s absurd, but charmingly interesting to look at, and technically well composed, lit, and processed.</td>', 'I wish this were in the running!  It is, I think, my favourite entry overall.  It''s absurd, but charmingly interesting to look at, and technically well composed, lit, and processed.', '2010-03-08 23:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895834, 859138, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this gentle picture, where the daisies look like they look in real life.  Even the colours look very much like a warm evening.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like this gentle picture, where the daisies look like they look in real life.  Even the colours look very much like a warm evening.  Nicely done.', '2010-03-08 23:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895848, 859100, 15711, '<td valign="top">Delicious and very Monet-esque.  YES!!</td>', 'Delicious and very Monet-esque.  YES!!', '2010-03-08 23:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
