(5895855, 859204, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is either Ursula or someone trying to copy her style.  WIth that in mind, I don''t like it as much as some of her others.  It''s less intimate by being less cropped. 6</td>', 'This is either Ursula or someone trying to copy her style.  WIth that in mind, I don''t like it as much as some of her others.  It''s less intimate by being less cropped. 6', '2010-03-09 00:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
