(5895861, 859128, 5112, '<td valign="top">Why the border?????  ;P<br/> <br/>Flip horizontal and vertical, crop 1/3 off the right (or the left), and voila!<br/> <br/>Anyway.  Actually, this isn''t half bad.  I kinda like it.  It reminds me of some rather beautiful flower shots.  I like all the little polka-dots.</td>', 'Why the border?????  ;P Flip horizontal and vertical, crop 1/3 off the right (or the left), and voila! Anyway.  Actually, this isn''t half bad.  I kinda like it.  It reminds me of some rather beautiful flower shots.  I like all the little polka-dots.', '2010-03-09 00:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895862, 859125, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!!!!!!</td>', 'Oh yes!!!!!!', '2010-03-09 00:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
