(5895868, 857856, 40718, '<td valign="top">Honestly I think the title says that you already know the shot doesn''t really stand on its own and could only do so with a number of qualifications.  I''ve actually voted some shots like this among the top, but unfortunately the large negative space of the V-shaped shadow dominates too much for my taste.  I have to give it a 4.  But take a seed of hope in knowing I''ve been using the 1, 2, and 3 in this challenge more than usual.</td>', 'Honestly I think the title says that you already know the shot doesn''t really stand on its own and could only do so with a number of qualifications.  I''ve actually voted some shots like this among the top, but unfortunately the large negative space of the V-shaped shadow dominates too much for my taste.  I have to give it a 4.  But take a seed of hope in knowing I''ve been using the 1, 2, and 3 in this challenge more than usual.', '2010-03-09 00:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5895869, 859145, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOD that''s cool.  I think it suits the challenge perfectly.  And the title is pot on.</td>', 'GOD that''s cool.  I think it suits the challenge perfectly.  And the title is pot on.', '2010-03-09 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
