(5896048, 859176, 100393, '<td valign="top">This says <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=99506" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">lutchenko</a> to me.... I don''t know why... It does just.<br/> <br/>I''m really liking the involved set-up and the thinking behind the idea but I think going down this route, in order to preserve your ''picture'' illusion has meant that there is only some much drama and interest in the lighting. The clever execution will certainly get you some votes but I think shooting the hand, thistle and goo against black with no frame and more interesting targeted low-key lighting might have made for a better image.<br/> <br/>Having said all that, I can appreciate the work here. 7.</td>', 'This says  lutchenko to me.... I don''t know why... It does just. I''m really liking the involved set-up and the thinking behind the idea but I think going down this route, in order to preserve your ''picture'' illusion has meant that there is only some much drama and interest in the lighting. The clever execution will certainly get you some votes but I think shooting the hand, thistle and goo against black with no frame and more interesting targeted low-key lighting might have made for a better image. Having said all that, I can appreciate the work here. 7.', '2010-03-09 05:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
