(5896645, 858339, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the challenge and one that I would hang on a wall.  I''m glad you weren''t afraid of color - you did a nice job with the hues.  Also appreciate that you found something lurking in your image, that''s the funnest part of goofing around with blur and abstracts, imo.  Good luck :)</td>', 'This is my favorite of the challenge and one that I would hang on a wall.  I''m glad you weren''t afraid of color - you did a nice job with the hues.  Also appreciate that you found something lurking in your image, that''s the funnest part of goofing around with blur and abstracts, imo.  Good luck :)', '2010-03-09 13:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
