(5897073, 858282, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Almost looks like it could be a stage presentation.</td>', 'I really like this. Almost looks like it could be a stage presentation.', '2010-03-09 18:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897074, 859252, 52336, '<td valign="top">Sufficiently weird to qualify as "fine art".  Personally I don''t connect, but I''m sure it will do well.  On the technical side, I notice hot highlights in the hair, which isn''t really a big deal.  I enjoy the softness of the (faceless) model coupled with the coarse texture of the curtains.</td>', 'Sufficiently weird to qualify as "fine art".  Personally I don''t connect, but I''m sure it will do well.  On the technical side, I notice hot highlights in the hair, which isn''t really a big deal.  I enjoy the softness of the (faceless) model coupled with the coarse texture of the curtains.', '2010-03-09 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897077, 858383, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and you did a good job with it.</td>', 'Nice idea and you did a good job with it.', '2010-03-09 18:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897080, 859221, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. The lighting is great.</td>', 'Very nice job. The lighting is great.', '2010-03-09 18:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897082, 858913, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is really wild. The black &amp; white works well and the clouds are great.</td>', 'This is really wild. The black & white works well and the clouds are great.', '2010-03-09 18:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897085, 859240, 52336, '<td valign="top">Architecturally interesting, but not evocative for me of "fine art".  A technically better photograph could have been taken as well, I think, if done at a different time of day.</td>', 'Architecturally interesting, but not evocative for me of "fine art".  A technically better photograph could have been taken as well, I think, if done at a different time of day.', '2010-03-09 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897087, 858600, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Very nice job.</td>', 'This is a great shot. Very nice job.', '2010-03-09 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897091, 858425, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very neat shot but I''m sorry I don''t get the title.</td>', 'Very neat shot but I''m sorry I don''t get the title.', '2010-03-09 18:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897095, 859227, 23484, '<td valign="top">That''s great. Title works very well.</td>', 'That''s great. Title works very well.', '2010-03-09 18:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897115, 858932, 52336, '<td valign="top">Why this works for me: I connect with the scene, having been there, at that age.  It feels lonely; I like that.  The duotone is lovely.  The flora is beautiful.  The dark shirt against the light boy+grass is interesting.  I can smell the hay, or barley, or whatever it is.<br/> <br/>Why this doesn''t work for me: I don''t connect with the scene other than through superficial memories of childhood.  To me, "fine art" is emotive on a darker, or a deeper, scale; this is neither.  The seemingly purposefully selected and saturated element near centre-left (a leaf or something) is contrived, in my view.</td>', 'Why this works for me: I connect with the scene, having been there, at that age.  It feels lonely; I like that.  The duotone is lovely.  The flora is beautiful.  The dark shirt against the light boy+grass is interesting.  I can smell the hay, or barley, or whatever it is. Why this doesn''t work for me: I don''t connect with the scene other than through superficial memories of childhood.  To me, "fine art" is emotive on a darker, or a deeper, scale; this is neither.  The seemingly purposefully selected and saturated element near centre-left (a leaf or something) is contrived, in my view.', '2010-03-09 18:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897119, 858361, 52336, '<td valign="top">Oblique against what?  Anyway, this is an interesting abstract through macro, but doesn''t move me very much.  I expect to see this sort of thing in other, more purposed challenges.  To that end, it doesn''t work, for me.  Nice textures, though, but could have benefited from a deeper depth of field.</td>', 'Oblique against what?  Anyway, this is an interesting abstract through macro, but doesn''t move me very much.  I expect to see this sort of thing in other, more purposed challenges.  To that end, it doesn''t work, for me.  Nice textures, though, but could have benefited from a deeper depth of field.', '2010-03-09 18:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897123, 858525, 68769, '<td valign="top">I can see this in a gallery, great work..</td>', 'I can see this in a gallery, great work..', '2010-03-09 18:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897125, 858917, 52336, '<td valign="top">Po-mo, weird for the sake of weird; for me, this rarely works as fine art.  It doesn''t connect with me here.  It''s interesting compositionally, and nicely taken care of in framing/contrast/tone etc., but not interesting to me otherwise.  And, I see Cthulu in there, or the FSM, or some such. ;)</td>', 'Po-mo, weird for the sake of weird; for me, this rarely works as fine art.  It doesn''t connect with me here.  It''s interesting compositionally, and nicely taken care of in framing/contrast/tone etc., but not interesting to me otherwise.  And, I see Cthulu in there, or the FSM, or some such. ;)', '2010-03-09 18:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897127, 859111, 68769, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower photograph..</td>', 'Lovely flower photograph..', '2010-03-09 18:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897129, 858793, 68769, '<td valign="top">One of the few that take it to the next level, well done..</td>', 'One of the few that take it to the next level, well done..', '2010-03-09 18:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897130, 859246, 68769, '<td valign="top">Where is that? Nice IR work, liked..</td>', 'Where is that? Nice IR work, liked..', '2010-03-09 18:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
