(5897255, 859049, 52336, '<td valign="top">Try as I might, I can''t find out what "Spinogue" is.  What I think *this* is is a lamp on a glass table.  It''s very high key, and I don''t understand it; many times that makes for a good "fine art" photo, but not for me, this time.  What is it all about, one wonders.  Who are you, and what are you saying?</td>', 'Try as I might, I can''t find out what "Spinogue" is.  What I think *this* is is a lamp on a glass table.  It''s very high key, and I don''t understand it; many times that makes for a good "fine art" photo, but not for me, this time.  What is it all about, one wonders.  Who are you, and what are you saying?', '2010-03-09 19:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
