(5898197, 858023, 80908, '<td valign="top">An unusual artefact and great use of the rule of thirds in composition, but let down for me by the surface, background and slightly dull lighting/ Perhaps recomposed in a darker situation with more directed lighting this could be an excellent subject!</td>', 'An unusual artefact and great use of the rule of thirds in composition, but let down for me by the surface, background and slightly dull lighting/ Perhaps recomposed in a darker situation with more directed lighting this could be an excellent subject!', '2010-03-10 07:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
