(5898453, 859187, 50034, '<td valign="top">What a Unique Bokeh Bouquet!  High marks for ART!  "The jury is still out" on how it will play photographically, but I give you a "7" for ART, and for Uniqueness, since this is probably THE MOST UNUSUAL display of Bokeh that I have ever seen!  KUDOS!  :)</td>', 'What a Unique Bokeh Bouquet!  High marks for ART!  "The jury is still out" on how it will play photographically, but I give you a "7" for ART, and for Uniqueness, since this is probably THE MOST UNUSUAL display of Bokeh that I have ever seen!  KUDOS!  :)', '2010-03-10 11:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
