(5899267, 858536, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition very much - can''t help wondering what this would look like in b/w. You probably tried that though, so I''ll take your word for it that color is better - actually I like the muted colors too.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition very much - can''t help wondering what this would look like in b/w. You probably tried that though, so I''ll take your word for it that color is better - actually I like the muted colors too.', '2010-03-10 20:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899273, 859127, 100831, '<td valign="top">The grain (a screen I''m supposing) is terrific. Love the tones and the light as well. I know that all fine art is supposed to be framed but I think this would be just as good without it (MY opinion, of course).<br/>Oh - and you live in an awesomely lovely place.</td>', 'The grain (a screen I''m supposing) is terrific. Love the tones and the light as well. I know that all fine art is supposed to be framed but I think this would be just as good without it (MY opinion, of course).Oh - and you live in an awesomely lovely place.', '2010-03-10 20:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899278, 858485, 100831, '<td valign="top">it looks lonely down there.</td>', 'it looks lonely down there.', '2010-03-10 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899361, 858917, 57447, '<td valign="top">Creative entry, well balanced too.</td>', 'Creative entry, well balanced too.', '2010-03-10 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
