(5899441, 859108, 83845, '<td valign="top">Not happy about the big white border, but I would compare this to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ursula</a>''s work, which is amazing.  Love this!</td>', 'Not happy about the big white border, but I would compare this to  ursula''s work, which is amazing.  Love this!', '2010-03-10 23:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
