(5899793, 859100, 21714, '<td valign="top">Those colours. They do really work. I find it beautiful.</td>', 'Those colours. They do really work. I find it beautiful.', '2010-03-11 09:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899794, 858240, 70270, '<td valign="top">very pink floydish, nice find and comp</td>', 'very pink floydish, nice find and comp', '2010-03-11 09:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899795, 859023, 21714, '<td valign="top">I enjoy seeing the world in a different way and this one makes me smile. Well done.</td>', 'I enjoy seeing the world in a different way and this one makes me smile. Well done.', '2010-03-11 09:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899799, 858744, 21714, '<td valign="top">Ah ... my fetish!</td>', 'Ah ... my fetish!', '2010-03-11 09:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899808, 859239, 104841, '<td valign="top">I like the pose that you model has here. Personally I think that there is too much of a yellow tint to the shot, if it was not intentional you can remove (lessen) it by adjusting your white balance.</td>', 'I like the pose that you model has here. Personally I think that there is too much of a yellow tint to the shot, if it was not intentional you can remove (lessen) it by adjusting your white balance.', '2010-03-11 10:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899837, 859183, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice vibe but not all that interesting to me.</td>', 'Nice vibe but not all that interesting to me.', '2010-03-11 10:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899841, 859244, 32767, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot I like about the feel of this shot but handlebars rank pretty low as a point of interest for me.</td>', 'There''s a lot I like about the feel of this shot but handlebars rank pretty low as a point of interest for me.', '2010-03-11 10:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899846, 859228, 72103, '<td valign="top">so close to brilliant......I love surreal art.  I would have shot lower, ths angle looks to human if you know what i mean.... still a 9</td>', 'so close to brilliant......I love surreal art.  I would have shot lower, ths angle looks to human if you know what i mean.... still a 9', '2010-03-11 11:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899854, 859228, 1232, '<td valign="top">love it ;) 10 from me</td>', 'love it ;) 10 from me', '2010-03-11 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899858, 859022, 35334, '<td valign="top">Something is about to happen; I''m not sure what. I love the way the figures strongly suggest the gender differences.</td>', 'Something is about to happen; I''m not sure what. I love the way the figures strongly suggest the gender differences.', '2010-03-11 11:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899863, 858654, 35334, '<td valign="top">Wow! Are we back in the early years of the cold war with that television set? Is the model nurturing a bit of life in the midst of bleakness? Very nice.</td>', 'Wow! Are we back in the early years of the cold war with that television set? Is the model nurturing a bit of life in the midst of bleakness? Very nice.', '2010-03-11 11:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899872, 857856, 35334, '<td valign="top">Detail of a Rothko. Nice.</td>', 'Detail of a Rothko. Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899874, 859159, 35334, '<td valign="top">Alive with color. Nice.</td>', 'Alive with color. Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899877, 858906, 35334, '<td valign="top">It looks dead and preserved. Nice.</td>', 'It looks dead and preserved. Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899879, 858361, 35334, '<td valign="top">A fading beauty! Nice.</td>', 'A fading beauty! Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899881, 858390, 35334, '<td valign="top">And time to shave your legs. It is evocative of the places I lived when I was young and poor. Nice.</td>', 'And time to shave your legs. It is evocative of the places I lived when I was young and poor. Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899882, 859115, 35334, '<td valign="top">A pile of skulls on the way to hell. Nice.</td>', 'A pile of skulls on the way to hell. Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899883, 859100, 35334, '<td valign="top">A bit brighter than Monet. Nice.</td>', 'A bit brighter than Monet. Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899884, 859088, 52336, '<td valign="top">Though simple in composition (and maybe not perfect), this has a lovely early-era sensibility about it, perhaps ''forties.  The background noise (wall texture?) is very pleasing.  The shadow effect is nicely balanced with the object casting it.  Thank you.</td>', 'Though simple in composition (and maybe not perfect), this has a lovely early-era sensibility about it, perhaps ''forties.  The background noise (wall texture?) is very pleasing.  The shadow effect is nicely balanced with the object casting it.  Thank you.', '2010-03-11 11:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899887, 858719, 52336, '<td valign="top">Some things that might have helped me appreciate this more might have been: a different focus effect, perhaps extremely shallow, sharper on the front blossoms and receding to bokeh at the dress; a dutone with warm colours; a film grain effect in the above-mentioned bokeh.  This would have given this a needed "fine art" feel for me; as it is, this seems more like narrative and less like art.  Pretty, otherwise.</td>', 'Some things that might have helped me appreciate this more might have been: a different focus effect, perhaps extremely shallow, sharper on the front blossoms and receding to bokeh at the dress; a dutone with warm colours; a film grain effect in the above-mentioned bokeh.  This would have given this a needed "fine art" feel for me; as it is, this seems more like narrative and less like art.  Pretty, otherwise.', '2010-03-11 11:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899888, 858912, 52336, '<td valign="top">Sentimental, and thus not very impacting, for me.  A few technical qualities lessen its impact as well.</td>', 'Sentimental, and thus not very impacting, for me.  A few technical qualities lessen its impact as well.', '2010-03-11 11:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899889, 858956, 52336, '<td valign="top">Much too busy for me to appreciate photographically, much too recognizable for me to acknowledge its abstraction.  Not in the category "fine art" in my opinion.</td>', 'Much too busy for me to appreciate photographically, much too recognizable for me to acknowledge its abstraction.  Not in the category "fine art" in my opinion.', '2010-03-11 11:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899890, 859170, 52336, '<td valign="top">Sometimes, abstraction works for fine art, sometimes less so.  "Fine art" is important to me in that it makes me feel something; your example fails to connect with me.  Concerning tone and contrast, it''s very interesting.</td>', 'Sometimes, abstraction works for fine art, sometimes less so.  "Fine art" is important to me in that it makes me feel something; your example fails to connect with me.  Concerning tone and contrast, it''s very interesting.', '2010-03-11 11:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899891, 858890, 52336, '<td valign="top">Not quite "fine art" for me, but compositionally well presented.  Too small for a challenge entry I feel, and focus is not done well for this photo.  It seems this demands either sharp focus, or a presentation of some kind depth of field that gives it subtler meaning.</td>', 'Not quite "fine art" for me, but compositionally well presented.  Too small for a challenge entry I feel, and focus is not done well for this photo.  It seems this demands either sharp focus, or a presentation of some kind depth of field that gives it subtler meaning.', '2010-03-11 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899892, 859039, 52336, '<td valign="top">Quixotic.  Queer.  Quiet.  Questionable.</td>', 'Quixotic.  Queer.  Quiet.  Questionable.', '2010-03-11 11:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899895, 859219, 52336, '<td valign="top">Aggressively processed, and thus not appealing for me.  Does not work as fine art, in my view (that is, odd or abstracted or blatantly metaphoric does not necessarily mean "fine art").</td>', 'Aggressively processed, and thus not appealing for me.  Does not work as fine art, in my view (that is, odd or abstracted or blatantly metaphoric does not necessarily mean "fine art").', '2010-03-11 11:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899897, 859227, 52336, '<td valign="top">One of the "weird = fine art" efforts I think, or submitting that an everyday subject photographed in an unusual manner will equal fine art.  I''m not so sure about that.  Technically interesting, with pleasing light; the big black block does nothing for me, and I would have preferred seeing something more restrained back there, a neutral background filled with the soft shadow of the flower, and texture, as of film grain.  A restrained split tone in blue would have been lovely too.</td>', 'One of the "weird = fine art" efforts I think, or submitting that an everyday subject photographed in an unusual manner will equal fine art.  I''m not so sure about that.  Technically interesting, with pleasing light; the big black block does nothing for me, and I would have preferred seeing something more restrained back there, a neutral background filled with the soft shadow of the flower, and texture, as of film grain.  A restrained split tone in blue would have been lovely too.', '2010-03-11 11:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899898, 858846, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The leaf in the background on its own would have made for an even more interesting photo, for me.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The leaf in the background on its own would have made for an even more interesting photo, for me.', '2010-03-11 11:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899899, 859195, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is outdoor art, yes, but I''m not sure your image constitutes "fine art".  At any rate, I would have loved to see you expressed in your photo, but I do not see that.  I see the art of others.</td>', 'This is outdoor art, yes, but I''m not sure your image constitutes "fine art".  At any rate, I would have loved to see you expressed in your photo, but I do not see that.  I see the art of others.', '2010-03-11 11:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899901, 859081, 52336, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  Sorry, but the shadow of the blinds detracts, destroying the delicacy of the flower, for me.</td>', 'Pretty.  Sorry, but the shadow of the blinds detracts, destroying the delicacy of the flower, for me.', '2010-03-11 11:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899902, 858600, 52336, '<td valign="top">Some technical aspects detract, for me: the sharpening method used; the shadow/highlight (or other hdr) fix.  Compositionally interesting but not outstanding.  I love places like this, though, so it''s nice from that perspective, personally.</td>', 'Some technical aspects detract, for me: the sharpening method used; the shadow/highlight (or other hdr) fix.  Compositionally interesting but not outstanding.  I love places like this, though, so it''s nice from that perspective, personally.', '2010-03-11 11:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899903, 859066, 52336, '<td valign="top">Simply doesn''t work for me in that it is too aggressively processed.  The prosaic subject matter is not helped by the processing.</td>', 'Simply doesn''t work for me in that it is too aggressively processed.  The prosaic subject matter is not helped by the processing.', '2010-03-11 11:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899904, 859054, 52336, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but not "fine art" in my view.  You''ve a lovely bokeh going on back there though.</td>', 'Pretty, but not "fine art" in my view.  You''ve a lovely bokeh going on back there though.', '2010-03-11 11:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899905, 859225, 52336, '<td valign="top">Hm... I''m truly sorry, but I just don''t buy it.  Some things that might have improved it for me: care taken with the angles at the door (straighten them in post, or frame for less distortion or use a different lens); duotone or b/w (the great salvager of uneven colour and the hallmark of "fine art", at least imo); a different position for your model, and expression.  It just seems somewhat cliched for my taste.</td>', 'Hm... I''m truly sorry, but I just don''t buy it.  Some things that might have improved it for me: care taken with the angles at the door (straighten them in post, or frame for less distortion or use a different lens); duotone or b/w (the great salvager of uneven colour and the hallmark of "fine art", at least imo); a different position for your model, and expression.  It just seems somewhat cliched for my taste.', '2010-03-11 11:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899906, 859243, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and understated, and would have been better without the border.  Lovely otherwise, thank you.</td>', 'Very pretty and understated, and would have been better without the border.  Lovely otherwise, thank you.', '2010-03-11 11:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899907, 858572, 52336, '<td valign="top">This really has trouble finding a place as "fine art" in my view.</td>', 'This really has trouble finding a place as "fine art" in my view.', '2010-03-11 11:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899908, 858236, 35334, '<td valign="top">Death come to us all. Nice photograph. I assume that this is a sculpture and thus credit for the artistic vision should go to the sculptor, but you have taken advantage of it to create a powerful photo.</td>', 'Death come to us all. Nice photograph. I assume that this is a sculpture and thus credit for the artistic vision should go to the sculptor, but you have taken advantage of it to create a powerful photo.', '2010-03-11 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899909, 859124, 52336, '<td valign="top">You''ve tried to give this a painting''s feeling with your use of blur.  I don''t particularly like it, because it''s unrestrained, and the effect obvious.  Maybe if instead you had softened your focus with your lens, concentrated on the fellow with the hat in the foreground and let the soft grass disappear into bokeh, not worrying about anyone else, then finished with a lovely golden duotone, I would have been more moved.  But I don''t see you in your photo, though you might be here; does it mean something to you?</td>', 'You''ve tried to give this a painting''s feeling with your use of blur.  I don''t particularly like it, because it''s unrestrained, and the effect obvious.  Maybe if instead you had softened your focus with your lens, concentrated on the fellow with the hat in the foreground and let the soft grass disappear into bokeh, not worrying about anyone else, then finished with a lovely golden duotone, I would have been more moved.  But I don''t see you in your photo, though you might be here; does it mean something to you?', '2010-03-11 11:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899910, 859209, 52336, '<td valign="top">Surely this is a zoo picture.  And surely you had to adjust levels to get that featureless black.  I don''t think it''s fine art, personally, though some may like this picture of an animal.  It doesn''t connect with me, unfortunately.  It is simply evocative of the zoo, or predatory felines, and has nothing else to say to me.  Does it mean anything to you?  Technically, the tones are very rich, the contrast well done, the black and white superb.  I don''t buy that rich black.. that was not in the original, I think.  I believe your focus is somewhere mid-animal, and should properly be on the eyes, but that may be an illusion of the light.</td>', 'Surely this is a zoo picture.  And surely you had to adjust levels to get that featureless black.  I don''t think it''s fine art, personally, though some may like this picture of an animal.  It doesn''t connect with me, unfortunately.  It is simply evocative of the zoo, or predatory felines, and has nothing else to say to me.  Does it mean anything to you?  Technically, the tones are very rich, the contrast well done, the black and white superb.  I don''t buy that rich black.. that was not in the original, I think.  I believe your focus is somewhere mid-animal, and should properly be on the eyes, but that may be an illusion of the light.', '2010-03-11 11:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899912, 859023, 52336, '<td valign="top">Spare and interesting.  The horizontal/vertical movement in the clouds and the figures is intriguing.  A pleasing composition.  Personally, "fine art" photos are usually emotive for me, but this is rather sterile, and doesn''t hit me where I live.  I reserve judgement as to whether this is successful or not.</td>', 'Spare and interesting.  The horizontal/vertical movement in the clouds and the figures is intriguing.  A pleasing composition.  Personally, "fine art" photos are usually emotive for me, but this is rather sterile, and doesn''t hit me where I live.  I reserve judgement as to whether this is successful or not.', '2010-03-11 11:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899913, 858536, 35334, '<td valign="top">It looks like you melted! It makes me think that you view yourself as shifting and changing. Nice.</td>', 'It looks like you melted! It makes me think that you view yourself as shifting and changing. Nice.', '2010-03-11 11:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899915, 859176, 52336, '<td valign="top">Is it fine art?  I don''t know.  My definition is: a photograph that says something about the photographer, that deeply impresses him/her and thereby moves the viewer, that connects with the viewer in a way that wasn''t expected, that has a story to tell about the photographer in an oblique metaphor that might seem at once impenetrable and accessible, that is not obvious in technique, that shows who the photographer is, that shows the photographer is in there somewhere, invested in the imagery.  There are a few issues with technicals that are largely unimportant, and you are a talented photographer, and this is doing well; but what does it mean to you, really?</td>', 'Is it fine art?  I don''t know.  My definition is: a photograph that says something about the photographer, that deeply impresses him/her and thereby moves the viewer, that connects with the viewer in a way that wasn''t expected, that has a story to tell about the photographer in an oblique metaphor that might seem at once impenetrable and accessible, that is not obvious in technique, that shows who the photographer is, that shows the photographer is in there somewhere, invested in the imagery.  There are a few issues with technicals that are largely unimportant, and you are a talented photographer, and this is doing well; but what does it mean to you, really?', '2010-03-11 11:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899916, 859029, 52336, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s the duotone, the Rorschach-esque figures that beg for interpretation, or the multiple layers of texture, but whatever it is, this works for me.  Very pleasing, very satisfying.  It *clicked* for me.  Thanks.</td>', 'Not sure if it''s the duotone, the Rorschach-esque figures that beg for interpretation, or the multiple layers of texture, but whatever it is, this works for me.  Very pleasing, very satisfying.  It *clicked* for me.  Thanks.', '2010-03-11 11:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899917, 858350, 52336, '<td valign="top">It''s probably the garish colour pumping, but this doesn''t work at all for me, not as an abstraction, and certainly not as "fine art".  If the colour choice was saner, I might have understood.  Unfortunately, I don''t get it.</td>', 'It''s probably the garish colour pumping, but this doesn''t work at all for me, not as an abstraction, and certainly not as "fine art".  If the colour choice was saner, I might have understood.  Unfortunately, I don''t get it.', '2010-03-11 11:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899918, 858945, 52336, '<td valign="top">A nice almost European feel, but not fine art, for me.  Something''s missing... not the rider, or anyone in particular, but something isn''t being said.  What was meant by all this?</td>', 'A nice almost European feel, but not fine art, for me.  Something''s missing... not the rider, or anyone in particular, but something isn''t being said.  What was meant by all this?', '2010-03-11 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899919, 859100, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice little place, with pretty reflections, but not fine art.  Technically somewhat in need of something -- sharpening?  Colour adjustments?  Something to make me connect with it?  I wish there was more of you in there somewhere.</td>', 'Nice little place, with pretty reflections, but not fine art.  Technically somewhat in need of something -- sharpening?  Colour adjustments?  Something to make me connect with it?  I wish there was more of you in there somewhere.', '2010-03-11 11:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899921, 859108, 52336, '<td valign="top">Firstly, your border is overstated.  Restraint or nothing would have been more effective.  But otherwise a lovely and soft image, restrained and delicate, an abstraction that for some reason *does* work as fine art in my opinion, unlike so many others presented.  The colours are lovely, the composition perfect; I am moved by the movement of the photograph.  <i>I see you in there.</i>  Thank you.</td>', 'Firstly, your border is overstated.  Restraint or nothing would have been more effective.  But otherwise a lovely and soft image, restrained and delicate, an abstraction that for some reason *does* work as fine art in my opinion, unlike so many others presented.  The colours are lovely, the composition perfect; I am moved by the movement of the photograph.  I see you in there.  Thank you.', '2010-03-11 11:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899923, 859213, 52336, '<td valign="top">Looks like a shot through a store of some kind, perhaps?  Evocation like that usually detracts for me, and doesn''t make me think "fine art".  This is an interesting shot of light rays, though.  I get the sense that you''ve interpreted abstraction as fine art.  For me, the two aren''t necessarily synonymous.</td>', 'Looks like a shot through a store of some kind, perhaps?  Evocation like that usually detracts for me, and doesn''t make me think "fine art".  This is an interesting shot of light rays, though.  I get the sense that you''ve interpreted abstraction as fine art.  For me, the two aren''t necessarily synonymous.', '2010-03-11 11:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899926, 859033, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is something of a contrived image, in my opinion.  Taken at face value, it doesn''t mean much to me.  Looking at it for a while, I appreciate not the subject, or the forced metaphor in your title, but the shapes.  There are a lot of interesting shapes to consider, and the entire canvas is carved in a curious and intriguing way by these two.  But what does it mean?  What duality were you trying to evoke?  I don''t understand you.  Technically, the contrast and tones are nice, the light is good, but there is something odd about the featureless black.</td>', 'This is something of a contrived image, in my opinion.  Taken at face value, it doesn''t mean much to me.  Looking at it for a while, I appreciate not the subject, or the forced metaphor in your title, but the shapes.  There are a lot of interesting shapes to consider, and the entire canvas is carved in a curious and intriguing way by these two.  But what does it mean?  What duality were you trying to evoke?  I don''t understand you.  Technically, the contrast and tones are nice, the light is good, but there is something odd about the featureless black.', '2010-03-11 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899927, 859212, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and unusually presented.  Great crop.  Unusual choice of duo, but effective.  Thanks.</td>', 'Very pretty and unusually presented.  Great crop.  Unusual choice of duo, but effective.  Thanks.', '2010-03-11 11:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899929, 859128, 52336, '<td valign="top">Might be interesting razor-sharp, with an aspect ratio that complements the shape of the animal, and without the border.  I could see it as very popular wall art.  Your b/w is effective for this subject.  Very nice.  (But are you invested in this photograph, does it equal "fine art"?  Who do I think you are, with this?)</td>', 'Might be interesting razor-sharp, with an aspect ratio that complements the shape of the animal, and without the border.  I could see it as very popular wall art.  Your b/w is effective for this subject.  Very nice.  (But are you invested in this photograph, does it equal "fine art"?  Who do I think you are, with this?)', '2010-03-11 11:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899930, 859015, 52336, '<td valign="top">Not working at all for me as fine art, and I believe your use of hdr or other adjustments is simply too aggressive and unrestrained to help me appreciate what else it might be.</td>', 'Not working at all for me as fine art, and I believe your use of hdr or other adjustments is simply too aggressive and unrestrained to help me appreciate what else it might be.', '2010-03-11 11:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899934, 859097, 52336, '<td valign="top">Too obscure to be effective, though I see that you''ve tried to give us the sense of the horizontal movement of the grain against the relatively pleasing shape of the reflection.  You saw something there, and you photographed it, and I think it meant something to you at the time, and so thank you.</td>', 'Too obscure to be effective, though I see that you''ve tried to give us the sense of the horizontal movement of the grain against the relatively pleasing shape of the reflection.  You saw something there, and you photographed it, and I think it meant something to you at the time, and so thank you.', '2010-03-11 11:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899935, 859187, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice as urban/street, not quote "fine art" though.</td>', 'Nice as urban/street, not quote "fine art" though.', '2010-03-11 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899939, 859129, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice.  In my view, more pop art than fine art; I can see this on the walls of people''s houses everywhere.  The composition is good, the snaky line cutting the scene very effective, the colours pleasing.  It is not fine art in that I don''t know what it means, or, by having viewed it, who you are, and if you care.</td>', 'Nice.  In my view, more pop art than fine art; I can see this on the walls of people''s houses everywhere.  The composition is good, the snaky line cutting the scene very effective, the colours pleasing.  It is not fine art in that I don''t know what it means, or, by having viewed it, who you are, and if you care.', '2010-03-11 11:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899944, 859204, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  A rushing stream with the evocation of animal fur.  Clever and pleasing.  I just don''t know if it''s fine art, but I''m certain it would be very popular.  Something doesn''t say "you", though, and that disturbs me.</td>', 'Very pretty.  A rushing stream with the evocation of animal fur.  Clever and pleasing.  I just don''t know if it''s fine art, but I''m certain it would be very popular.  Something doesn''t say "you", though, and that disturbs me.', '2010-03-11 11:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899973, 858551, 50641, '<td valign="top">nice!  what we did today was walk in the mud!  great tones and contrast.</td>', 'nice!  what we did today was walk in the mud!  great tones and contrast.', '2010-03-11 12:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899974, 859035, 50641, '<td valign="top">a nice example of selective desat enhancing an image</td>', 'a nice example of selective desat enhancing an image', '2010-03-11 12:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899975, 859143, 50641, '<td valign="top">appealing blur and beautiful subtle palette.  the three nearly-evenly-spaced ships really make this for me.</td>', 'appealing blur and beautiful subtle palette.  the three nearly-evenly-spaced ships really make this for me.', '2010-03-11 12:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899976, 859122, 50641, '<td valign="top">the peacock and the ostrich.  very silverfoxxy.  wonder if it will win both thingies.</td>', 'the peacock and the ostrich.  very silverfoxxy.  wonder if it will win both thingies.', '2010-03-11 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899978, 858808, 50641, '<td valign="top">stark stark stark.  and vivid.  excellent juxtaposition.  like the message too.</td>', 'stark stark stark.  and vivid.  excellent juxtaposition.  like the message too.', '2010-03-11 12:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899979, 857872, 113740, '<td valign="top">I''m in awe. :) 10. Very, very nicely done, imho. :)</td>', 'I''m in awe. :) 10. Very, very nicely done, imho. :)', '2010-03-11 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899980, 858525, 50641, '<td valign="top">aren''t inversions fun?</td>', 'aren''t inversions fun?', '2010-03-11 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899985, 859179, 50641, '<td valign="top">the diagonal of duck, dude and diving sun is what does it for me.  nice touch with the deepened blacks.</td>', 'the diagonal of duck, dude and diving sun is what does it for me.  nice touch with the deepened blacks.', '2010-03-11 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899987, 859023, 50641, '<td valign="top">this picture makes me feel skinny</td>', 'this picture makes me feel skinny', '2010-03-11 12:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899988, 858883, 50641, '<td valign="top">and it''s a well-executed dive.  lots to see in here but my favorite is the birdie face in the middle, no wait, there are two of them.</td>', 'and it''s a well-executed dive.  lots to see in here but my favorite is the birdie face in the middle, no wait, there are two of them.', '2010-03-11 12:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899989, 858719, 50641, '<td valign="top">perfect glow and nice vintage hues, lock of hair a great touch</td>', 'perfect glow and nice vintage hues, lock of hair a great touch', '2010-03-11 12:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899990, 859096, 50641, '<td valign="top">interesting story</td>', 'interesting story', '2010-03-11 12:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5899993, 859223, 113740, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Feels like I''m there almost. lol :) 9.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Feels like I''m there almost. lol :) 9.', '2010-03-11 12:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900040, 859205, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not really caring for this, but I think it''s a personal appeal thing, rather than anything really wrong with your entry.</td>', 'Not really caring for this, but I think it''s a personal appeal thing, rather than anything really wrong with your entry.', '2010-03-11 13:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900058, 859249, 83313, '<td valign="top">The idea of advertising in people''s dreams was a good idea, but there was no way of making sure those ads were being placed into pleasant dreams instead of nightmares.</td>', 'The idea of advertising in people''s dreams was a good idea, but there was no way of making sure those ads were being placed into pleasant dreams instead of nightmares.', '2010-03-11 13:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900067, 859226, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog smell woman, time to mate. Follow smell. Grog find big pots... no female? Grog sue for deceptive advertising practices.</td>', 'Grog smell woman, time to mate. Follow smell. Grog find big pots... no female? Grog sue for deceptive advertising practices.', '2010-03-11 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900068, 858793, 113278, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love the bright light followed by all of the dark space. a 9 from me.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love the bright light followed by all of the dark space. a 9 from me.', '2010-03-11 13:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900069, 859022, 113278, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. This is one that is fun to explore and really appreciate. Voted earlier.</td>', 'I love this shot. This is one that is fun to explore and really appreciate. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900070, 858954, 113278, '<td valign="top">Great composition on this. The simplicity of the colors works well with how you composed everything. Voted earlier.</td>', 'Great composition on this. The simplicity of the colors works well with how you composed everything. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900072, 859219, 83313, '<td valign="top">Coming off to me as a bit flat and overprocessed. I do see the effort to do something a bit different with this, it''s just not grabbing me at all, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Coming off to me as a bit flat and overprocessed. I do see the effort to do something a bit different with this, it''s just not grabbing me at all, I''m afraid.', '2010-03-11 13:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900073, 858775, 113278, '<td valign="top">Love the blur and textures on this as well as the simple color. one of my favorites in the challenge. Voted earlier.</td>', 'Love the blur and textures on this as well as the simple color. one of my favorites in the challenge. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900076, 859162, 113278, '<td valign="top">So very nice. The B&amp;W works well (or perhaps you just used colors that made it look B&amp;W hard to tell with the clarity on the hand) All in all very nice. Voted earlier.</td>', 'So very nice. The B&W works well (or perhaps you just used colors that made it look B&W hard to tell with the clarity on the hand) All in all very nice. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900079, 857976, 113278, '<td valign="top">Nice, almost an Edgar Allen Poe feel to this one. Love it. Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nice, almost an Edgar Allen Poe feel to this one. Love it. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900082, 859145, 113278, '<td valign="top">I really like how this could pass as a painting. Love all the textures and color and blur. Really well done. Voted earlier.</td>', 'I really like how this could pass as a painting. Love all the textures and color and blur. Really well done. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:24:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5900083, 858768, 113278, '<td valign="top">Great simplicity and yet I could stare at it for quite some time. It has a sort of ellegance to it. Very nice. Voted earlier.</td>', 'Great simplicity and yet I could stare at it for quite some time. It has a sort of ellegance to it. Very nice. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900084, 859250, 83313, '<td valign="top">2586 2586, 78012012. 13131135!!!! I''m so glad we understand each other, 5.10!</td>', '2586 2586, 78012012. 13131135!!!! I''m so glad we understand each other, 5.10!', '2010-03-11 13:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900085, 859169, 113278, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I could see this hanging in a gallery, even in my place if I had a spot for it. Love the patterns and color. Nice job. Voted earlier.</td>', 'Very cool, I could see this hanging in a gallery, even in my place if I had a spot for it. Love the patterns and color. Nice job. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900086, 859029, 113278, '<td valign="top">Great patterns on this. This is one that you can look at and start seeing different objects, kind of like looking at cloud formations. Great job. Voted earlier.</td>', 'Great patterns on this. This is one that you can look at and start seeing different objects, kind of like looking at cloud formations. Great job. Voted earlier.', '2010-03-11 13:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900088, 858654, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is just too weird. Awesomely creative and well done.</td>', 'This is just too weird. Awesomely creative and well done.', '2010-03-11 13:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900090, 858913, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the surrealism here!</td>', 'Love the surrealism here!', '2010-03-11 13:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900091, 859179, 113278, '<td valign="top">I did not score this shot high and felt it only fair to tell you why. It is a very pretty picture and well composed but to me it doesn''t convey fine art (of course I am speaking of my definition of fine art). So I think you took a very nice photo but I am just not getting FA from it. Good luck.</td>', 'I did not score this shot high and felt it only fair to tell you why. It is a very pretty picture and well composed but to me it doesn''t convey fine art (of course I am speaking of my definition of fine art). So I think you took a very nice photo but I am just not getting FA from it. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 13:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900093, 858978, 113278, '<td valign="top">For me this doesnt say Fine Art, or at least what I think of as fine art.</td>', 'For me this doesnt say Fine Art, or at least what I think of as fine art.', '2010-03-11 13:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900094, 858023, 113278, '<td valign="top">Sorry but for me this doesn''t say Fine art and the mattress is a bit of a distracting element, perhaps using a solid color sheet would help. Also the lighting seems a bit off as well and doesn''t really flow.</td>', 'Sorry but for me this doesn''t say Fine art and the mattress is a bit of a distracting element, perhaps using a solid color sheet would help. Also the lighting seems a bit off as well and doesn''t really flow.', '2010-03-11 13:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900096, 859086, 113278, '<td valign="top">Originally this was a 2 from me. I am bumping it up because I actually though about entering something like a white canvas with a simple red line through it. This is something, imho, that you could run across in a modern art gallery. I am not giving it one of my top scores but it is going up quite a bit from the original 2. Good luck.</td>', 'Originally this was a 2 from me. I am bumping it up because I actually though about entering something like a white canvas with a simple red line through it. This is something, imho, that you could run across in a modern art gallery. I am not giving it one of my top scores but it is going up quite a bit from the original 2. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 13:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900097, 858914, 113278, '<td valign="top">Art is a funny thing in that while it has definitions, those definitions are different for each person either creating or viewing the art. I am sure you probably see this as an excellent interpetation as Fine Art but for me it doesn''t convey my feeling or thought of what Fine Art is. Because of that I scored this low even though it is a well done photo.</td>', 'Art is a funny thing in that while it has definitions, those definitions are different for each person either creating or viewing the art. I am sure you probably see this as an excellent interpetation as Fine Art but for me it doesn''t convey my feeling or thought of what Fine Art is. Because of that I scored this low even though it is a well done photo.', '2010-03-11 13:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900103, 858943, 113278, '<td valign="top">This really doesn''t seem to be Fine Art, imho. Alas that is the curious thing about art, all of our definitions could vary drastically from one viewer to the next. Good luck.</td>', 'This really doesn''t seem to be Fine Art, imho. Alas that is the curious thing about art, all of our definitions could vary drastically from one viewer to the next. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 13:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900104, 858492, 113278, '<td valign="top">Originally this was a low vote from me but now that I have revisited it I like how it seems to be coming out of my screen and hanging down. A pretty cool effect. I also like the use of negative space. Bumping this vote up a bit now.</td>', 'Originally this was a low vote from me but now that I have revisited it I like how it seems to be coming out of my screen and hanging down. A pretty cool effect. I also like the use of negative space. Bumping this vote up a bit now.', '2010-03-11 13:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900107, 858897, 113278, '<td valign="top">Sorry but for me this really just seems like a portrait with nothing special and, imho, no Fine Art quality. May just be my opinion and the great, terrible, funny, crazy, stressful, interesting thing with art is our varying definitions. Good Luck.</td>', 'Sorry but for me this really just seems like a portrait with nothing special and, imho, no Fine Art quality. May just be my opinion and the great, terrible, funny, crazy, stressful, interesting thing with art is our varying definitions. Good Luck.', '2010-03-11 13:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900137, 858808, 113278, '<td valign="top">Personally I think this image would be stronger, and in my opinion on fine art would fit my definition better if the sign were to be eliminated from the shot.</td>', 'Personally I think this image would be stronger, and in my opinion on fine art would fit my definition better if the sign were to be eliminated from the shot.', '2010-03-11 14:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900139, 858671, 113278, '<td valign="top">Hmm... to bad you couldn''t use this for the Branch challenge coming up. As far as for the Fine Art challenge, for me at least, this doesn''t really protray that.</td>', 'Hmm... to bad you couldn''t use this for the Branch challenge coming up. As far as for the Fine Art challenge, for me at least, this doesn''t really protray that.', '2010-03-11 14:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900143, 859250, 113278, '<td valign="top">Everyones opinion on what constitutes Fine Art varries greatly and I believe our views do not see eye to eye on this entry. It is a fine shot but for me it just doesn''t do it. Good Luck.</td>', 'Everyones opinion on what constitutes Fine Art varries greatly and I believe our views do not see eye to eye on this entry. It is a fine shot but for me it just doesn''t do it. Good Luck.', '2010-03-11 14:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900144, 858636, 113278, '<td valign="top">You have some neat effects and processing going on in tis image but for me and my thoughts of Fine Art this just falls short. Good Luck.</td>', 'You have some neat effects and processing going on in tis image but for me and my thoughts of Fine Art this just falls short. Good Luck.', '2010-03-11 14:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900146, 859040, 113278, '<td valign="top">Here I am again looking at a shot I scored low and wondering what I was thinking. I actually like this after looking again and again, it still isn''t in my top picks but you have cleared your way from the low end. The ligh and shadows works nicely for this image and the trees are a nice addition.</td>', 'Here I am again looking at a shot I scored low and wondering what I was thinking. I actually like this after looking again and again, it still isn''t in my top picks but you have cleared your way from the low end. The ligh and shadows works nicely for this image and the trees are a nice addition.', '2010-03-11 14:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900148, 858297, 113278, '<td valign="top">Maybe I am just not getting it but I have tried and tried and have looked several times at this but it is just missing me. I am sure there may be a cool meaning or something behind this shot but if there is you shot it a bit too far above my head. Sorry, hope you do well.</td>', 'Maybe I am just not getting it but I have tried and tried and have looked several times at this but it is just missing me. I am sure there may be a cool meaning or something behind this shot but if there is you shot it a bit too far above my head. Sorry, hope you do well.', '2010-03-11 14:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900150, 858035, 113278, '<td valign="top">A 3. Yep I gave this a 3. Now I am changing it to a higher number after taking more time with this shot. The simplicity and all the negative space coupled with a rubber duck grows on you. I actually kinda like this one now, still not a top pick from me but it is moving on up. Good luck.</td>', 'A 3. Yep I gave this a 3. Now I am changing it to a higher number after taking more time with this shot. The simplicity and all the negative space coupled with a rubber duck grows on you. I actually kinda like this one now, still not a top pick from me but it is moving on up. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 14:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900152, 859079, 113278, '<td valign="top">I have been taking the time to go back though my votes and spend a bit more time on each shot. I just don''t really get this one. Maybe that means it is a success as art. For me and my thought of what fine art is this just doesn''t seem to work. Hope you do well.</td>', 'I have been taking the time to go back though my votes and spend a bit more time on each shot. I just don''t really get this one. Maybe that means it is a success as art. For me and my thought of what fine art is this just doesn''t seem to work. Hope you do well.', '2010-03-11 14:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900154, 859084, 113278, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better cropped in half. For me I just don''t care for both lines in the shot and, imho, I think it would be better, for me at least, if it focused on just half of the photo.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better cropped in half. For me I just don''t care for both lines in the shot and, imho, I think it would be better, for me at least, if it focused on just half of the photo.', '2010-03-11 14:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900157, 859219, 113278, '<td valign="top">I suppose this could be Fine Art and you may have gotten comments from voters loving it. Of course our opinions on art are so vast I will be interested to see how this entire challenge finishes up. But for me on this shot I just don''t really care for it and I don''t see the Fine Art in it, of course that may just be me, who knows. But good luck to you and also did you mean to leave that section of the border above the rabitt different?</td>', 'I suppose this could be Fine Art and you may have gotten comments from voters loving it. Of course our opinions on art are so vast I will be interested to see how this entire challenge finishes up. But for me on this shot I just don''t really care for it and I don''t see the Fine Art in it, of course that may just be me, who knows. But good luck to you and also did you mean to leave that section of the border above the rabitt different?', '2010-03-11 14:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900162, 858323, 113278, '<td valign="top">In my opinion and thought of fine art this just doesn''t really seem to fit. It isn''t a bad shot but for me and my opinion it just isn''t what I would consider Fine Art. Good luck.</td>', 'In my opinion and thought of fine art this just doesn''t really seem to fit. It isn''t a bad shot but for me and my opinion it just isn''t what I would consider Fine Art. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900164, 859140, 113278, '<td valign="top">And yet another low score from me that I am bumping up. I like how you framed this and I think it would be interesting to see hung in a gallery. Still isn''t one of my top picks but it isn''t one of my low scores now. Good luck.</td>', 'And yet another low score from me that I am bumping up. I like how you framed this and I think it would be interesting to see hung in a gallery. Still isn''t one of my top picks but it isn''t one of my low scores now. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900167, 859187, 113278, '<td valign="top">In my humbled and possibly skewed vision of what I feel constitutes Fine Art this doesn''t fit. I just am missing the Fine Art feel of it, my opinion of course, and I just seem to be missing it. Good luck.</td>', 'In my humbled and possibly skewed vision of what I feel constitutes Fine Art this doesn''t fit. I just am missing the Fine Art feel of it, my opinion of course, and I just seem to be missing it. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 14:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900169, 858395, 113278, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait with great eyes and excellent emotion but I don''t see this as Fine Art, sorry. Good luck.</td>', 'A nice portrait with great eyes and excellent emotion but I don''t see this as Fine Art, sorry. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 14:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900171, 859195, 113278, '<td valign="top">The sculptures may very well be art but, for me at least, the photo doesn''t really bring home the fine art feel. For me at least it just seems like a tourist shot in a museum. Good luck to you though.</td>', 'The sculptures may very well be art but, for me at least, the photo doesn''t really bring home the fine art feel. For me at least it just seems like a tourist shot in a museum. Good luck to you though.', '2010-03-11 14:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900172, 859124, 100393, '<td valign="top">One of my 9s - lovely dreamy stuff. Make me want to take a deep breath!</td>', 'One of my 9s - lovely dreamy stuff. Make me want to take a deep breath!', '2010-03-11 14:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
