(5900320, 859004, 65234, '<td valign="top">This one resonates with me simply because I have a fair number of little mosses growing in my yard, and it never fails to amaze me when I water a dry one and watch the seed heads visibly unfurl.  It''s just cool!  Amazing little organisms.</td>', 'This one resonates with me simply because I have a fair number of little mosses growing in my yard, and it never fails to amaze me when I water a dry one and watch the seed heads visibly unfurl.  It''s just cool!  Amazing little organisms.', '2010-03-11 16:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900323, 858536, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Adds a whole ''nother dimension to a self portrait, with ambiguous details that spark my imagination.  A little yellow, maybe, so perhaps would benefit from a white balance correction, unless that particular color is meant to make a statement which eludes me.  I do think it has more impact in color than it would in B&amp;W.  Not that subtlety is a bad thing in a piece of art.</td>', 'Great idea!  Adds a whole ''nother dimension to a self portrait, with ambiguous details that spark my imagination.  A little yellow, maybe, so perhaps would benefit from a white balance correction, unless that particular color is meant to make a statement which eludes me.  I do think it has more impact in color than it would in B&W.  Not that subtlety is a bad thing in a piece of art.', '2010-03-11 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5900325, 859209, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and detail and nothing to detract from the subject.  Nice sort of diagonal going from teh head to the tail.  I will admit to a bias towards animal shots so I''m predisposed to like this ;-)</td>', 'Beautiful light and detail and nothing to detract from the subject.  Nice sort of diagonal going from teh head to the tail.  I will admit to a bias towards animal shots so I''m predisposed to like this ;-)', '2010-03-11 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
