(5900473, 859197, 113278, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty shot but for me it seems like so many shots we see in challenges every week or at least month. So while it is excellent it doesn''t fit in with what my personal view of fine art is. Good luck.</td>', 'This is a pretty shot but for me it seems like so many shots we see in challenges every week or at least month. So while it is excellent it doesn''t fit in with what my personal view of fine art is. Good luck.', '2010-03-11 18:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
