(5901070, 859064, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots thats simple, elegant, and very artistic... The definition and sharp edges of the clouds are what really set it off... Great shot 9</td>', 'This is one of those shots thats simple, elegant, and very artistic... The definition and sharp edges of the clouds are what really set it off... Great shot 9', '2010-03-12 10:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901071, 859248, 93283, '<td valign="top">I love the movement in this shot. I really like the overall feel of the image, very artistic. 9</td>', 'I love the movement in this shot. I really like the overall feel of the image, very artistic. 9', '2010-03-12 10:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901073, 858906, 50641, '<td valign="top">crunchy!</td>', 'crunchy!', '2010-03-12 10:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901074, 858917, 93283, '<td valign="top">If you asked me now, I really couldn''t tell you what exactly I like about this photo...All I know, is that in art, it doesn''t really matter why you like, or what you like about it, its just that you like it and it appeals to you... So, with that said, I gave it an 8. I think its creative and interesting... Well done!</td>', 'If you asked me now, I really couldn''t tell you what exactly I like about this photo...All I know, is that in art, it doesn''t really matter why you like, or what you like about it, its just that you like it and it appeals to you... So, with that said, I gave it an 8. I think its creative and interesting... Well done!', '2010-03-12 10:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901076, 858361, 93283, '<td valign="top">I love the edginess of this shot. Its crisp and the detail is superb... Well done 8</td>', 'I love the edginess of this shot. Its crisp and the detail is superb... Well done 8', '2010-03-12 10:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901078, 859252, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot is awesome... I love the blank face, wonderful touch... Really has an interesting feel... 8</td>', 'This shot is awesome... I love the blank face, wonderful touch... Really has an interesting feel... 8', '2010-03-12 10:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901080, 859129, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very unique abstract with good symmetry. Its an interesting shot because it stands out from the rest in this challenge... Well done 9</td>', 'Very unique abstract with good symmetry. Its an interesting shot because it stands out from the rest in this challenge... Well done 9', '2010-03-12 10:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901082, 858536, 93283, '<td valign="top">I love the melted look of this image... Very cool concept and well done 8</td>', 'I love the melted look of this image... Very cool concept and well done 8', '2010-03-12 10:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901084, 859145, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is really a funky shot. I like it, kinda reminds me a dream that I could remember if only I had woken up a minute earlier...</td>', 'This is really a funky shot. I like it, kinda reminds me a dream that I could remember if only I had woken up a minute earlier...', '2010-03-12 10:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901085, 858967, 93283, '<td valign="top">Props for use of the rubiks cube! I love the floating effect and the gritty background... Cool shot</td>', 'Props for use of the rubiks cube! I love the floating effect and the gritty background... Cool shot', '2010-03-12 10:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901086, 858236, 93283, '<td valign="top">Whoaa... for a moment there I thought that was a dead Avatar... :) Anyway, creepy, awesome, interesting, and fine art all rolled into one... Great shot!</td>', 'Whoaa... for a moment there I thought that was a dead Avatar... :) Anyway, creepy, awesome, interesting, and fine art all rolled into one... Great shot!', '2010-03-12 10:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901087, 857870, 104230, '<td valign="top">Being of Welsh heritage I appreciate the daffodil and love spoon (not sure what the second object behind that is).  No red dragons available?! Nice light, but the selective desaturation doesn''t work for me here. I think that is because the area of color is relatively isolated from the rest of the image.</td>', 'Being of Welsh heritage I appreciate the daffodil and love spoon (not sure what the second object behind that is).  No red dragons available?! Nice light, but the selective desaturation doesn''t work for me here. I think that is because the area of color is relatively isolated from the rest of the image.', '2010-03-12 10:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901089, 859108, 93283, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot... This is the kind of piece that my parents would love, it looks like allot of art that they currently have. Love the colors, and pretty much everything else. A fine piece of art 9</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot... This is the kind of piece that my parents would love, it looks like allot of art that they currently have. Love the colors, and pretty much everything else. A fine piece of art 9', '2010-03-12 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901091, 858563, 93283, '<td valign="top">What I really love about this shot, is the fact that it tells a story... Now, its up to the viewer to decide what that story is, that is what is so fascinating about the shot... Very well done...</td>', 'What I really love about this shot, is the fact that it tells a story... Now, its up to the viewer to decide what that story is, that is what is so fascinating about the shot... Very well done...', '2010-03-12 10:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901093, 859242, 93283, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome abstract... Very well done. This is another piece that I am not really sure why I like it, but I do... Perhaps that is the measure of great artwork, when you look at it, you simply like it</td>', 'Simply awesome abstract... Very well done. This is another piece that I am not really sure why I like it, but I do... Perhaps that is the measure of great artwork, when you look at it, you simply like it', '2010-03-12 10:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901095, 858654, 93283, '<td valign="top">The leather and old school t.v. are a nice touch... I just find this to be an interesting shot... I wish my prom date dressed like that, gas mask and all... That woulda been a story for the Grandkids... I digress... Great shot!</td>', 'The leather and old school t.v. are a nice touch... I just find this to be an interesting shot... I wish my prom date dressed like that, gas mask and all... That woulda been a story for the Grandkids... I digress... Great shot!', '2010-03-12 10:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901099, 859086, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot is simply awesome... The color, tones, and overall feel are all quite pleasing... Perfect shot for a Fine Arts challenge, well done 8</td>', 'This shot is simply awesome... The color, tones, and overall feel are all quite pleasing... Perfect shot for a Fine Arts challenge, well done 8', '2010-03-12 10:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901100, 858694, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot. Definitely an excellent work of Fine Art... I love the colors and tones, Great shot!</td>', 'Very intriguing shot. Definitely an excellent work of Fine Art... I love the colors and tones, Great shot!', '2010-03-12 10:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901101, 858968, 93283, '<td valign="top">Love the abstract... The colors and tones are wonderful, definitely an excellent piece of Fine Art... Great shot!</td>', 'Love the abstract... The colors and tones are wonderful, definitely an excellent piece of Fine Art... Great shot!', '2010-03-12 10:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901102, 859131, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot is interesting because the cracks in the wall and the mildew... It speaks decay and tells a story... I like it 8</td>', 'This shot is interesting because the cracks in the wall and the mildew... It speaks decay and tells a story... I like it 8', '2010-03-12 10:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901104, 859144, 93283, '<td valign="top">Okay, this shot is just cool... Great choice of contrast with the color tones... I find this shot to be incredibly interesting and its a perfect fit for a Fine Arts challenge... Well Done!!! 8</td>', 'Okay, this shot is just cool... Great choice of contrast with the color tones... I find this shot to be incredibly interesting and its a perfect fit for a Fine Arts challenge... Well Done!!! 8', '2010-03-12 10:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901107, 859249, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot is just cool... I love the colors and tonal range, it works very well... I wonder how many people caught the fauvism reference? Anyway, its a great shot that fits nicely in this challenge... Great shot! 8</td>', 'This shot is just cool... I love the colors and tonal range, it works very well... I wonder how many people caught the fauvism reference? Anyway, its a great shot that fits nicely in this challenge... Great shot! 8', '2010-03-12 10:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901183, 859249, 108544, '<td valign="top">Crazy PP! I could see this on a wall! Nice....</td>', 'Crazy PP! I could see this on a wall! Nice....', '2010-03-12 11:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901185, 859174, 108544, '<td valign="top">This could be on a gallery wall. I just love the tones and shading. Oh and the wear and tear on the feet, really helps with the feel of the image.  Great exhibit!</td>', 'This could be on a gallery wall. I just love the tones and shading. Oh and the wear and tear on the feet, really helps with the feel of the image.  Great exhibit!', '2010-03-12 11:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901186, 857780, 108544, '<td valign="top">The mist or fog, really helps with a sense of depth in this image. Yeah, I love it! Great colour and tones. I can almost feel the dew, coming to rest on my glasses. Well worth getting up early for, unless it was a sunset. You should do very well. Great wall hanger!</td>', 'The mist or fog, really helps with a sense of depth in this image. Yeah, I love it! Great colour and tones. I can almost feel the dew, coming to rest on my glasses. Well worth getting up early for, unless it was a sunset. You should do very well. Great wall hanger!', '2010-03-12 11:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901188, 859227, 108544, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet elegantly lit. I like it!</td>', 'Simple, yet elegantly lit. I like it!', '2010-03-12 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901190, 859228, 108544, '<td valign="top">So fits this challenge. I can just imagine this hanging on a wall. Like the centered comp and interesting PP.<br/>Yeah, it keeps me stairing. Great work!</td>', 'So fits this challenge. I can just imagine this hanging on a wall. Like the centered comp and interesting PP.Yeah, it keeps me stairing. Great work!', '2010-03-12 11:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901193, 859057, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very artistic shot, honestly, reminds me of something I''d see in a Tim Burton film... Good concept and execution too! Great shot</td>', 'Very artistic shot, honestly, reminds me of something I''d see in a Tim Burton film... Good concept and execution too! Great shot', '2010-03-12 11:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901196, 859162, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good contrast between the foreground and the background, which can be hard to do... Overall it has a nice artsy feel and I like it</td>', 'Very nice shot, good contrast between the foreground and the background, which can be hard to do... Overall it has a nice artsy feel and I like it', '2010-03-12 11:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901197, 858538, 108544, '<td valign="top">Really like the image! Love the shadows and frost/ texture on the background.</td>', 'Really like the image! Love the shadows and frost/ texture on the background.', '2010-03-12 11:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901198, 859125, 93283, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it has a kind of dark, desolate feel to it. Its unique from some of the other images in a sense that it isn''t a set-up studio shot, and there aren''t many other images like this in the challenge... Nicely done</td>', 'I like this shot, it has a kind of dark, desolate feel to it. Its unique from some of the other images in a sense that it isn''t a set-up studio shot, and there aren''t many other images like this in the challenge... Nicely done', '2010-03-12 11:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901199, 859212, 108544, '<td valign="top">This one is really making me open the eyes. Can''t wait to recognize this subject. Yeah, I may have to wait and see. <br/>Great work! I just hope people don''t nail you for the highlight. Which is interesting in my eye.<br/>Great Exhibit!</td>', 'This one is really making me open the eyes. Can''t wait to recognize this subject. Yeah, I may have to wait and see. Great work! I just hope people don''t nail you for the highlight. Which is interesting in my eye.Great Exhibit!', '2010-03-12 11:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901200, 858035, 93283, '<td valign="top">Quirky and cute were my first two thoughts. Definitely fitting in the Fine Arts challenge and could see something like this in a gallery.. Well done! On a side note, made me think of the Ernie song from sesame street...</td>', 'Quirky and cute were my first two thoughts. Definitely fitting in the Fine Arts challenge and could see something like this in a gallery.. Well done! On a side note, made me think of the Ernie song from sesame street...', '2010-03-12 11:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901201, 858234, 93283, '<td valign="top">Twisted, dark, and interesting were my first thoughts... I really like this image because its thought provoking. Definitely stands out in a Fine Arts challenge, good shot!</td>', 'Twisted, dark, and interesting were my first thoughts... I really like this image because its thought provoking. Definitely stands out in a Fine Arts challenge, good shot!', '2010-03-12 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901202, 859128, 93283, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure I''ve seen something similar to this on display in an exhibit, its an interesting shot and the contrast is excellent. Interesting subject too...</td>', 'I''m pretty sure I''ve seen something similar to this on display in an exhibit, its an interesting shot and the contrast is excellent. Interesting subject too...', '2010-03-12 11:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901204, 858775, 93283, '<td valign="top">What I really like about this image is that it makes you stop and think... Then as you think, your mind kinda wonders into what it could be... I like that, its simply thought provoking, and that makes it a very successful piece of art... Well done</td>', 'What I really like about this image is that it makes you stop and think... Then as you think, your mind kinda wonders into what it could be... I like that, its simply thought provoking, and that makes it a very successful piece of art... Well done', '2010-03-12 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901205, 858767, 108544, '<td valign="top">Very well thought out idea. Well, it looks that way to me. lol Is that a cutting board for a utility knife? Combined with some type of string? Either way a great entry! Kind looks like a demented clown. Yeah nightmares...lol<br/>Thanks for sharing such a nice image.</td>', 'Very well thought out idea. Well, it looks that way to me. lol Is that a cutting board for a utility knife? Combined with some type of string? Either way a great entry! Kind looks like a demented clown. Yeah nightmares...lolThanks for sharing such a nice image.', '2010-03-12 11:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901206, 859029, 93283, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast in this shot, its interesting and makes the viewer curious as to what the subject is. Overall a good shot for a fine arts challenge</td>', 'Love the contrast in this shot, its interesting and makes the viewer curious as to what the subject is. Overall a good shot for a fine arts challenge', '2010-03-12 11:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901208, 859250, 108544, '<td valign="top">Man the train needs some windex!</td>', 'Man the train needs some windex!', '2010-03-12 11:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901211, 858767, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is a really unique shot that stands out from the other images because it lacks grain, has color, and is quite upbeat... I like the subject too, its interesting and keeps the eyes wondering... Very cool</td>', 'This is a really unique shot that stands out from the other images because it lacks grain, has color, and is quite upbeat... I like the subject too, its interesting and keeps the eyes wondering... Very cool', '2010-03-12 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901215, 858425, 93283, '<td valign="top">Simple and a nice find... This shot really works well for this challenge. Very interesting use of shapes too!</td>', 'Simple and a nice find... This shot really works well for this challenge. Very interesting use of shapes too!', '2010-03-12 11:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901217, 857872, 108544, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and subtle tones of this. I am usually not the biggest pp fan. Ha, that sounded funny, but it works very well with this image. Great job and an excellent wall hanger!</td>', 'Love the colours and subtle tones of this. I am usually not the biggest pp fan. Ha, that sounded funny, but it works very well with this image. Great job and an excellent wall hanger!', '2010-03-12 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901218, 859122, 93283, '<td valign="top">Okay, this shot is just out there... but that of course, is the appeal... Its a very artistic shot and exemplifies the meaning of a fine arts challenge.. Definitely unique, it works very well and the execution was done well too... Nice shot</td>', 'Okay, this shot is just out there... but that of course, is the appeal... Its a very artistic shot and exemplifies the meaning of a fine arts challenge.. Definitely unique, it works very well and the execution was done well too... Nice shot', '2010-03-12 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901220, 859023, 93283, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this shot, from the movement, to the colors to the horizon... It really is a great shot for a Fine Arts challenge... Well Done</td>', 'Absolutely love this shot, from the movement, to the colors to the horizon... It really is a great shot for a Fine Arts challenge... Well Done', '2010-03-12 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901222, 859039, 93283, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the letter Q. Its a pretty cool shot. The snow falling around it makes for a really nice touch. Well done</td>', 'Interesting take on the letter Q. Its a pretty cool shot. The snow falling around it makes for a really nice touch. Well done', '2010-03-12 11:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901223, 858917, 83313, '<td valign="top">An udderly fascinating image.</td>', 'An udderly fascinating image.', '2010-03-12 11:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901226, 859176, 108544, '<td valign="top">Sick! A brilliant idea, very well executed! Like the lean of the background. Just helps pull me to the flower. Can''t wait to see the setup details. So please include them for me. Yeah, I am curious. Was the flower glued to the table? Or is it actually through the table top. Oh and what about the drip? <br/>Excellent!</td>', 'Sick! A brilliant idea, very well executed! Like the lean of the background. Just helps pull me to the flower. Can''t wait to see the setup details. So please include them for me. Yeah, I am curious. Was the flower glued to the table? Or is it actually through the table top. Oh and what about the drip? Excellent!', '2010-03-12 11:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901228, 857856, 93283, '<td valign="top">Okay this is a shot that is definitely artistic... Its about art, and this shot exemplifies that. The colors offset each other nicely and its an interesting abstract. Lastly, the grain patterns work well too so overall, I really like it.</td>', 'Okay this is a shot that is definitely artistic... Its about art, and this shot exemplifies that. The colors offset each other nicely and its an interesting abstract. Lastly, the grain patterns work well too so overall, I really like it.', '2010-03-12 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901230, 858954, 93283, '<td valign="top">Interesting patter and subject... The illusion of levitating is cool too. Its a good shot for a Fine Arts challenge... Well done</td>', 'Interesting patter and subject... The illusion of levitating is cool too. Its a good shot for a Fine Arts challenge... Well done', '2010-03-12 12:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901234, 859084, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the effort to try and do something different. It''s not doing anything to grab my attention, I''m afraid. No risk, no reward, right? My own entry of a bruised banana was not well received. (I *think* these are bananas...)</td>', 'I like the effort to try and do something different. It''s not doing anything to grab my attention, I''m afraid. No risk, no reward, right? My own entry of a bruised banana was not well received. (I *think* these are bananas...)', '2010-03-12 12:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901238, 859211, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just seems busy and not really doing much to get my attention, I''m afraid. I do appreciate seeing the attemtpts at trying something different, however. You don''t know if you don''t toss it in there.</td>', 'Just seems busy and not really doing much to get my attention, I''m afraid. I do appreciate seeing the attemtpts at trying something different, however. You don''t know if you don''t toss it in there.', '2010-03-12 12:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901241, 858525, 83313, '<td valign="top">Appears to be a flower, I think. I like the abstract approach you took.</td>', 'Appears to be a flower, I think. I like the abstract approach you took.', '2010-03-12 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901245, 859040, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think you were trying to capture some interesting shadows with this, but it comes off to me a bit on the uninteresting side. Maybe a different angle? More abstract? Idunno.</td>', 'I think you were trying to capture some interesting shadows with this, but it comes off to me a bit on the uninteresting side. Maybe a different angle? More abstract? Idunno.', '2010-03-12 12:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901257, 858834, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gonna skip the vote on this one since I know whose it is. (Saw it on your Flickr page the other day) Lots of nice detail and the slight sepia tone works well for it. About the only nitpick I really have is that I would suggest a little perspective correction on the left side, and maybe a touch of fisheye correction so that the view appears straight-on. (I do know from my own efforts at similar shots that it is harder than it looks to achieve that.)</td>', 'Gonna skip the vote on this one since I know whose it is. (Saw it on your Flickr page the other day) Lots of nice detail and the slight sepia tone works well for it. About the only nitpick I really have is that I would suggest a little perspective correction on the left side, and maybe a touch of fisheye correction so that the view appears straight-on. (I do know from my own efforts at similar shots that it is harder than it looks to achieve that.)', '2010-03-12 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901270, 859249, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all, just a bit too busy</td>', 'Not bad at all, just a bit too busy', '2010-03-12 12:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901280, 858297, 112828, '<td valign="top">A Warhol tribute ehh?  I like it!</td>', 'A Warhol tribute ehh?  I like it!', '2010-03-12 12:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
