(5901330, 859033, 36808, '<td valign="top">This entire week has been eerie.  I''ve met two set of twins, read two books my friend insisted I read (starring twins) and now this lovely haunting image that reminds me of the mysterious connection of twins. Love it.</td>', 'This entire week has been eerie.  I''ve met two set of twins, read two books my friend insisted I read (starring twins) and now this lovely haunting image that reminds me of the mysterious connection of twins. Love it.', '2010-03-12 13:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
