(5901445, 859096, 15711, '<td valign="top">the misty picnic<br/>the magical day<br/>one bite of apple<br/>he and she rode away <br/> <br/>the sweet grayed mare<br/>walked slow <br/>through the wood<br/>they soaked up each moment<br/>as only lovers could<br/> <br/>each moment<br/>each blink<br/>they treasured them, oh<br/>for never again<br/>would this place be so<br/> <br/>she withered away<br/>from a broken heart<br/>he wanders aimlessly<br/>no ending no start<br/> <br/>but smiles pour down<br/>on their faces each time<br/>they reminisce<br/>of this picnic sublime<br/> <br/>WOW - what an inspiration.  I saw this and the verse just poured out of me.  Stunning. 8</td>', 'the misty picnicthe magical dayone bite of applehe and she rode away  the sweet grayed marewalked slow through the woodthey soaked up each momentas only lovers could each momenteach blinkthey treasured them, ohfor never againwould this place be so she withered awayfrom a broken hearthe wanders aimlesslyno ending no start but smiles pour downon their faces each timethey reminisceof this picnic sublime WOW - what an inspiration.  I saw this and the verse just poured out of me.  Stunning. 8', '2010-03-12 15:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
