(5901456, 857780, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m on the fence as to whether I call this fine art or just a beautiful nature shot.  Nonetheless, it has so many elements I appreciate: the sun isn''t too hot yet it has that warm glow, the mist/fog creates a gauzey illusion, and the low scrub trees add a nice touch of silhouette in contrast to the clouds above.  Well done. 7</td>', 'I''m on the fence as to whether I call this fine art or just a beautiful nature shot.  Nonetheless, it has so many elements I appreciate: the sun isn''t too hot yet it has that warm glow, the mist/fog creates a gauzey illusion, and the low scrub trees add a nice touch of silhouette in contrast to the clouds above.  Well done. 7', '2010-03-12 15:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
