(5901543, 858968, 112828, '<td valign="top">Yes, very good.  I love the execution of this, but I must say that the colors (with the exception of the blue/white area) don''t really strike me as much as I would think they should.  Red, green, blue, all really great colors, they of course, blend into white (when speaking of light), so the white is good in there..  I still don''t love the color.. Odd how that works.. So you''re getting a 7 because I do like it, especially what you executed here, I just don''t LOVE the final results.<br/> <br/>-Cheers.</td>', 'Yes, very good.  I love the execution of this, but I must say that the colors (with the exception of the blue/white area) don''t really strike me as much as I would think they should.  Red, green, blue, all really great colors, they of course, blend into white (when speaking of light), so the white is good in there..  I still don''t love the color.. Odd how that works.. So you''re getting a 7 because I do like it, especially what you executed here, I just don''t LOVE the final results. -Cheers.', '2010-03-12 16:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
