(5901558, 859086, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh for some BLUE in this!!  I love that orange, it just wants a friend! 6</td>', 'Oh for some BLUE in this!!  I love that orange, it just wants a friend! 6', '2010-03-12 16:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901559, 859182, 112828, '<td valign="top">Zap!  You get a 6</td>', 'Zap!  You get a 6', '2010-03-12 16:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901561, 858862, 52336, '<td valign="top">Delightfully unappealing.  More "urban schtick" than "fine art".  With fine art photos, I want to be impressed either with the story conveyed by the photographer, or some oblique metaphor that has an instant connection with me.  I want to know who the photographer is, and what he/she thinks.  I only get, "This guy likes feet," or, "This gal likes guys who like feet" from this, and don''t really need/want to know anything else.  Technically, tones are lovely, contrast is great; the light is perfect for this scene.  Selective desat, which is usually so overdone, works well for this image.  Composition is spot-on.  Nice.</td>', 'Delightfully unappealing.  More "urban schtick" than "fine art".  With fine art photos, I want to be impressed either with the story conveyed by the photographer, or some oblique metaphor that has an instant connection with me.  I want to know who the photographer is, and what he/she thinks.  I only get, "This guy likes feet," or, "This gal likes guys who like feet" from this, and don''t really need/want to know anything else.  Technically, tones are lovely, contrast is great; the light is perfect for this scene.  Selective desat, which is usually so overdone, works well for this image.  Composition is spot-on.  Nice.', '2010-03-12 16:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901562, 858767, 112828, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I''m relying on the fact that you did this in camera and not in Photoshop :)<br/> <br/>You get an 8 and a maybe a(nother?) validation request :)</td>', 'This is great.  I''m relying on the fact that you did this in camera and not in Photoshop :) You get an 8 and a maybe a(nother?) validation request :)', '2010-03-12 16:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901565, 858768, 52336, '<td valign="top">One of the very few abstractions in this challenge that I could label "fine art".  Subtle and soft and restrained, an abstraction (of flowers?) that has the potential to be touching.  Me, I''m not as moved by this as others might be; but it is pretty nonetheless.  Thank you.</td>', 'One of the very few abstractions in this challenge that I could label "fine art".  Subtle and soft and restrained, an abstraction (of flowers?) that has the potential to be touching.  Me, I''m not as moved by this as others might be; but it is pretty nonetheless.  Thank you.', '2010-03-12 16:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901566, 858615, 112828, '<td valign="top">Bird takes bow.  Not a huge fan of this, but I don''t really hate it either.. 5...</td>', 'Bird takes bow.  Not a huge fan of this, but I don''t really hate it either.. 5...', '2010-03-12 16:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901567, 858383, 52336, '<td valign="top">Looks quite staged to me.  I''m not certain it qualifies as "fine" fine art.  On the plus side, you have your composition done nicely.</td>', 'Looks quite staged to me.  I''m not certain it qualifies as "fine" fine art.  On the plus side, you have your composition done nicely.', '2010-03-12 16:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901569, 858425, 112828, '<td valign="top">I like this very much...  7</td>', 'I like this very much...  7', '2010-03-12 16:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901570, 859228, 112828, '<td valign="top">Yes!  This is what I had in mind for this challenge..   As much as I love the images here that are obviously less processed, this one does really make me think "fine art"  I suspect this will ribbon, probably a blue.  For that I give you a trollish 2, largely because I haven''t seen 5 all week ;)<br/> <br/>(Nah, just kidding, you get a 9 on this)</td>', 'Yes!  This is what I had in mind for this challenge..   As much as I love the images here that are obviously less processed, this one does really make me think "fine art"  I suspect this will ribbon, probably a blue.  For that I give you a trollish 2, largely because I haven''t seen 5 all week ;) (Nah, just kidding, you get a 9 on this)', '2010-03-12 16:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901573, 858932, 112828, '<td valign="top">Yes, very good.  I''m trying for the life of me to figure out what that orange thing is..  Very interesting..</td>', 'Yes, very good.  I''m trying for the life of me to figure out what that orange thing is..  Very interesting..', '2010-03-12 16:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901574, 858775, 52336, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a reverse image of water streaming into water.  A beautiful abstraction.  Split tone is perfect; my favourite combination.  The play between calm below and frenetic movement above, and thus, smoothness vs. texture, is wonderful.  The stream intruding from the smooth into the rough is an interesting tension.  It IS a moving image, and I particularly enjoy communicative images, especially those claiming to be fine art.  I see you in there; it''s a beautiful, beautiful image, worthy of a win.  Thanks.</td>', 'Seems to be a reverse image of water streaming into water.  A beautiful abstraction.  Split tone is perfect; my favourite combination.  The play between calm below and frenetic movement above, and thus, smoothness vs. texture, is wonderful.  The stream intruding from the smooth into the rough is an interesting tension.  It IS a moving image, and I particularly enjoy communicative images, especially those claiming to be fine art.  I see you in there; it''s a beautiful, beautiful image, worthy of a win.  Thanks.', '2010-03-12 16:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901575, 859248, 57447, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of impact.  Nice work.</td>', 'This has a lot of impact.  Nice work.', '2010-03-12 16:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901576, 858906, 112828, '<td valign="top">Love the low-key..  Well done, and lovely texture, you have made this viewer question if this is a beautiful rose, or a wrinkled wreck :)</td>', 'Love the low-key..  Well done, and lovely texture, you have made this viewer question if this is a beautiful rose, or a wrinkled wreck :)', '2010-03-12 16:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901577, 859203, 57447, '<td valign="top">Visually cool processing.</td>', 'Visually cool processing.', '2010-03-12 16:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901578, 858775, 57447, '<td valign="top">Creative and artsy.</td>', 'Creative and artsy.', '2010-03-12 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901581, 858768, 112828, '<td valign="top">LOVE this.  Very very well done.</td>', 'LOVE this.  Very very well done.', '2010-03-12 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901582, 858282, 57447, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2010-03-12 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901583, 858492, 52336, '<td valign="top">I see an attempt at metaphor with this image.  I dislike forced metaphors, and therefore can''t appreciate this image, certainly not as fine art.  Technically, a levels fix might have made it stand out more, and b/w might have made it haunting, as would framing this from further away.  You''re on track with the composition, but something to suggest what this is all supposed to mean -- such as starkness or loneliness, and thus a larger area of white space around the subject -- would have enhanced.</td>', 'I see an attempt at metaphor with this image.  I dislike forced metaphors, and therefore can''t appreciate this image, certainly not as fine art.  Technically, a levels fix might have made it stand out more, and b/w might have made it haunting, as would framing this from further away.  You''re on track with the composition, but something to suggest what this is all supposed to mean -- such as starkness or loneliness, and thus a larger area of white space around the subject -- would have enhanced.', '2010-03-12 16:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901584, 859239, 52336, '<td valign="top">This suffers from several technical issues: an incorrect white balance setting; soft focus (which might be preferred but appears to be a defect here); a crop that removes a small portion of the top of the model''s head; blown highlights in the sheets at upper right.  These issues are easy to spot, and should have been addressed when setting up and processing.  As far as "fine art" is concerned, for me, this doesn''t qualify.  Otherwise, your model is posed nicely, and the choice of angle is good.</td>', 'This suffers from several technical issues: an incorrect white balance setting; soft focus (which might be preferred but appears to be a defect here); a crop that removes a small portion of the top of the model''s head; blown highlights in the sheets at upper right.  These issues are easy to spot, and should have been addressed when setting up and processing.  As far as "fine art" is concerned, for me, this doesn''t qualify.  Otherwise, your model is posed nicely, and the choice of angle is good.', '2010-03-12 16:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901585, 859162, 57447, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a bit of color in the calla.  Nice entry though.</td>', 'I would like to see a bit of color in the calla.  Nice entry though.', '2010-03-12 16:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901588, 859247, 57447, '<td valign="top">This is a mind bender, interesting entry and title.</td>', 'This is a mind bender, interesting entry and title.', '2010-03-12 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901590, 858995, 52336, '<td valign="top">An unfortunately literal interpretation of what fine art photography means.  As a photograph, the subject is prosaic; as fine art it does not work.  Are you invested in this image?  If there is another fine art challenge, enter it, and invest in the image, and its metaphor -- but don''t force a metaphor -- and what it means to you.</td>', 'An unfortunately literal interpretation of what fine art photography means.  As a photograph, the subject is prosaic; as fine art it does not work.  Are you invested in this image?  If there is another fine art challenge, enter it, and invest in the image, and its metaphor -- but don''t force a metaphor -- and what it means to you.', '2010-03-12 16:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901592, 859182, 52336, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Fine art?  Don''t know; don''t think so.  If you had connected with me or told me something about an opinion you have, or a dream or a hope, or what you think about something, fine art it would be.  I don''t think I interpret this as coming from someone invested in its imagery.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Fine art?  Don''t know; don''t think so.  If you had connected with me or told me something about an opinion you have, or a dream or a hope, or what you think about something, fine art it would be.  I don''t think I interpret this as coming from someone invested in its imagery.', '2010-03-12 16:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901593, 859096, 52336, '<td valign="top">Not fine art for me, but does have me wondering what''s so perfect about this day, and what all that smoke is, and where all the people have gone.  I see Stella beer, and a bite out of an apple, and some bread or something, and a shoe.  No people.  I think you want me to think they are making love somewhere.  Okay, I will.  Technically a tad dark, the elements we are meant to concentrate on are a little obscured, the existence of the smoke is probably unnecessary (you just wanted to use that smoke machine).  A higher vantage point, looking down at the residue of the couple, may have really helped this.  The mystery of b/w would have added to it, for me.  I don''t connect.</td>', 'Not fine art for me, but does have me wondering what''s so perfect about this day, and what all that smoke is, and where all the people have gone.  I see Stella beer, and a bite out of an apple, and some bread or something, and a shoe.  No people.  I think you want me to think they are making love somewhere.  Okay, I will.  Technically a tad dark, the elements we are meant to concentrate on are a little obscured, the existence of the smoke is probably unnecessary (you just wanted to use that smoke machine).  A higher vantage point, looking down at the residue of the couple, may have really helped this.  The mystery of b/w would have added to it, for me.  I don''t connect.', '2010-03-12 16:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901595, 858744, 52336, '<td valign="top">Looks like part of an old milkweed pod.  Pretty and spare.  Tones are gentle.  Cut-off of the shadow at left is unfortunate.  Composition well done.  I like it.  I think I sense the photographer''s intent, or some feeling he/she had whilst setting this up and taking it.  Nice.  Thank you.</td>', 'Looks like part of an old milkweed pod.  Pretty and spare.  Tones are gentle.  Cut-off of the shadow at left is unfortunate.  Composition well done.  I like it.  I think I sense the photographer''s intent, or some feeling he/she had whilst setting this up and taking it.  Nice.  Thank you.', '2010-03-12 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901598, 858913, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is the "odd = fine art" school, a school I don''t agree with.  It''s weird, I give you that, but is it you?  Is there anything being said or shown here that you really care about?  In my view, that''s the definition of fine art; that the photographer communicated something.  Weird is everywhere, and therefore is not unique or interesting.  Technically, a fine photo, suitably sharp, b/w well done, depth of field perfect, light wonderful, composition pleasing.</td>', 'This is the "odd = fine art" school, a school I don''t agree with.  It''s weird, I give you that, but is it you?  Is there anything being said or shown here that you really care about?  In my view, that''s the definition of fine art; that the photographer communicated something.  Weird is everywhere, and therefore is not unique or interesting.  Technically, a fine photo, suitably sharp, b/w well done, depth of field perfect, light wonderful, composition pleasing.', '2010-03-12 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901599, 858959, 52336, '<td valign="top">A very literal interpretation of the challenge that I cannot find engaging.</td>', 'A very literal interpretation of the challenge that I cannot find engaging.', '2010-03-12 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901601, 859171, 52336, '<td valign="top">Having difficulty finding the "art" that''s yours here.  Was looking forward to hearing something from each photographer, from being told something or asked to feel something.  This one doesn''t do that.  Technically, your processing is overdone.  You''ve pumped the blues to get that sky, and it shows.  Much colour fringing, especially in the sky.</td>', 'Having difficulty finding the "art" that''s yours here.  Was looking forward to hearing something from each photographer, from being told something or asked to feel something.  This one doesn''t do that.  Technically, your processing is overdone.  You''ve pumped the blues to get that sky, and it shows.  Much colour fringing, especially in the sky.', '2010-03-12 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901603, 858892, 52336, '<td valign="top">Not quite there for me, sorry.</td>', 'Not quite there for me, sorry.', '2010-03-12 16:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901606, 859040, 52336, '<td valign="top">Joli, mais pas particulièrement artistique.</td>', 'Joli, mais pas particulièrement artistique.', '2010-03-12 16:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901607, 858339, 52336, '<td valign="top">It''s glassware of some kind.  The abstraction is interesting, but its recognizability detracts somewhat for me.  It isn''t quite working in my opinion.</td>', 'It''s glassware of some kind.  The abstraction is interesting, but its recognizability detracts somewhat for me.  It isn''t quite working in my opinion.', '2010-03-12 16:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901608, 859221, 52336, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t work in a fine art challenge, unless your interpretation moves into the realm of pop art; in that case, many might enjoy this on their wall.  Technically fine.  Emotionally empty, for me, anyway.  Where is the photographer?  In the message, I mean?</td>', 'Doesn''t work in a fine art challenge, unless your interpretation moves into the realm of pop art; in that case, many might enjoy this on their wall.  Technically fine.  Emotionally empty, for me, anyway.  Where is the photographer?  In the message, I mean?', '2010-03-12 16:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901613, 859228, 52336, '<td valign="top">Well, yeah, that''s odd.  More Pink Floyd than Twilight Zone, in my opinion.  It would make a great album cover.  It doesn''t connect with me as fine art, though, even though it is technically well done apart from perhaps an issue with softness (such an image would benefit from razor-sharpness).  The sky worked for you in this photo, and the lighting, or the post hdr work or similar, is nice and restrained and effective.  But I don''t like it as fine art.  It is contrived.  It would have meant something to me, actually, without the model -- just the landscape in its rawness, with the low sky, threatening, a natural image evocative of mystery.</td>', 'Well, yeah, that''s odd.  More Pink Floyd than Twilight Zone, in my opinion.  It would make a great album cover.  It doesn''t connect with me as fine art, though, even though it is technically well done apart from perhaps an issue with softness (such an image would benefit from razor-sharpness).  The sky worked for you in this photo, and the lighting, or the post hdr work or similar, is nice and restrained and effective.  But I don''t like it as fine art.  It is contrived.  It would have meant something to me, actually, without the model -- just the landscape in its rawness, with the low sky, threatening, a natural image evocative of mystery.', '2010-03-12 16:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901614, 858852, 52336, '<td valign="top">A touch on the nose.</td>', 'A touch on the nose.', '2010-03-12 16:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901616, 859197, 52336, '<td valign="top">A pretty sky, a calm body of water, a sturdy bridge, the perfect vantage point, a nice picture.  But not fine art, for me.  I am looking for your feeling here, but because so many of us have these very straightforward sentiments, it does not look unique.</td>', 'A pretty sky, a calm body of water, a sturdy bridge, the perfect vantage point, a nice picture.  But not fine art, for me.  I am looking for your feeling here, but because so many of us have these very straightforward sentiments, it does not look unique.', '2010-03-12 16:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901620, 859084, 52336, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on bananas!  It works.  But does it work to understand what you were feeling (other than hunger) when you took this photo?  I don''t know.  But it''s oddly touching, for me, and I can''t explain it.  Too sharpened.  Not soft enough.</td>', 'Interesting take on bananas!  It works.  But does it work to understand what you were feeling (other than hunger) when you took this photo?  I don''t know.  But it''s oddly touching, for me, and I can''t explain it.  Too sharpened.  Not soft enough.', '2010-03-12 16:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901623, 858615, 52336, '<td valign="top">It''s a great bird photo, but it isn''t great fine art, for me.  I love connecting with or understanding the intention of a photographer producing fine art.  I don''t see you, here.</td>', 'It''s a great bird photo, but it isn''t great fine art, for me.  I love connecting with or understanding the intention of a photographer producing fine art.  I don''t see you, here.', '2010-03-12 16:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901624, 859125, 58610, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of contrast and tonality to make this interesting composition come to life.</td>', 'Wonderful use of contrast and tonality to make this interesting composition come to life.', '2010-03-12 16:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901625, 859078, 52336, '<td valign="top">That''s a lot of hair.  But it isn''t telling me anything I don''t already know, which is, in my view, the definition of fine art.</td>', 'That''s a lot of hair.  But it isn''t telling me anything I don''t already know, which is, in my view, the definition of fine art.', '2010-03-12 16:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901626, 859057, 52336, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I dislike forced metaphors, so I must ignore your title.  Is it fine art?  I don''t think it is, but it is delicate, if not somewhat overdone in post (too sharp, levels or something too adjusted).  I would have enjoyed this in a deeply contrasted split tone... maybe reds in the highlights and blue in the shadows.  I think the falling leaf is contrived, and I don''t like it.  The composition is too centred, and would have benefitted from a different choice of framing.  Lots of space on the left, I think.  Plus, I don''t understand what it is, other than what you think I should be thinking.  I''m looking for some kind of connection, in all of these images, and it''s difficult to find one.</td>', 'Pretty.  I dislike forced metaphors, so I must ignore your title.  Is it fine art?  I don''t think it is, but it is delicate, if not somewhat overdone in post (too sharp, levels or something too adjusted).  I would have enjoyed this in a deeply contrasted split tone... maybe reds in the highlights and blue in the shadows.  I think the falling leaf is contrived, and I don''t like it.  The composition is too centred, and would have benefitted from a different choice of framing.  Lots of space on the left, I think.  Plus, I don''t understand what it is, other than what you think I should be thinking.  I''m looking for some kind of connection, in all of these images, and it''s difficult to find one.', '2010-03-12 16:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901629, 859226, 52336, '<td valign="top">A nice abstraction.  Texture, light, and composition is very pleasing.  I think I get the sense of you, when you were taking the picture, fixing it up.  But the title... no, the title detracts.  If there is something I need to know about these objects to understand the title, then, once again, it doesn''t work.</td>', 'A nice abstraction.  Texture, light, and composition is very pleasing.  I think I get the sense of you, when you were taking the picture, fixing it up.  But the title... no, the title detracts.  If there is something I need to know about these objects to understand the title, then, once again, it doesn''t work.', '2010-03-12 16:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901630, 859244, 52336, '<td valign="top">Your post work is a bit much for my taste.  I have difficulty considering this "fine art"; it''s true that it''s an unusual picture of an object not often seen from an angle not expected, but those elements combined aren''t enough.  I would rather have known something about the photographer, and what he/she felt about the image presented.  I can''t tell anything about that, from this.</td>', 'Your post work is a bit much for my taste.  I have difficulty considering this "fine art"; it''s true that it''s an unusual picture of an object not often seen from an angle not expected, but those elements combined aren''t enough.  I would rather have known something about the photographer, and what he/she felt about the image presented.  I can''t tell anything about that, from this.', '2010-03-12 16:53:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5901631, 858595, 52336, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is one of the few images in this challenge of a prosaic object unusually photographed that actually works.  The softness is compelling, the tones are nice, the duo is perfect, shapes are intriguing and touching.  I feel it.  I believe you are in here, somewhere... thanks, it''s lovely.</td>', 'Okay, this is one of the few images in this challenge of a prosaic object unusually photographed that actually works.  The softness is compelling, the tones are nice, the duo is perfect, shapes are intriguing and touching.  I feel it.  I believe you are in here, somewhere... thanks, it''s lovely.', '2010-03-12 16:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901632, 859125, 52336, '<td valign="top">Really nicely presented.  Lovely and odd scene, and perfectly framed.  Black and white and tones/contrast are great.  Thanks.</td>', 'Really nicely presented.  Lovely and odd scene, and perfectly framed.  Black and white and tones/contrast are great.  Thanks.', '2010-03-12 16:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901639, 858323, 58610, '<td valign="top">This is exceptional.</td>', 'This is exceptional.', '2010-03-12 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901668, 859203, 112828, '<td valign="top">I HATE HDR..  and yet..  I like this.. Go figure.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'I HATE HDR..  and yet..  I like this.. Go figure. 8', '2010-03-12 17:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901671, 859100, 112828, '<td valign="top">A Monet ehh? 7</td>', 'A Monet ehh? 7', '2010-03-12 17:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901674, 859226, 112828, '<td valign="top">Escher too?!  Very good! 8</td>', 'Escher too?!  Very good! 8', '2010-03-12 17:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901678, 859169, 112828, '<td valign="top">I''m really hoping this is not a flat surface..  I''m giving you a 9 for this, and I will be very upset if this is not a 3 dimensional scene that you''ve captured.<br/> <br/>With that said, WOW, this looks great.</td>', 'I''m really hoping this is not a flat surface..  I''m giving you a 9 for this, and I will be very upset if this is not a 3 dimensional scene that you''ve captured. With that said, WOW, this looks great.', '2010-03-12 17:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901687, 858563, 41337, '<td valign="top">The lighting and setup are good but to be honest this is more commercial than fine art. It doesn''t make me think or feel and given your specific theme I should feel <i>something</i>.</td>', 'The lighting and setup are good but to be honest this is more commercial than fine art. It doesn''t make me think or feel and given your specific theme I should feel something.', '2010-03-12 17:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901693, 858572, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like it except for the title which is too literal.</td>', 'I like it except for the title which is too literal.', '2010-03-12 17:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901733, 859242, 112828, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful.  I''ve no idea what this was, and I don''t care, that deep blue with the bright orange/yellow... This is one of the top in this for me... I hope you ribbon..</td>', 'Just wonderful.  I''ve no idea what this was, and I don''t care, that deep blue with the bright orange/yellow... This is one of the top in this for me... I hope you ribbon..', '2010-03-12 18:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901734, 859108, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very excellent..  A top shot for me..  Deserves a ribbon.</td>', 'Very excellent..  A top shot for me..  Deserves a ribbon.', '2010-03-12 18:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901736, 859159, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice!<br/></td>', 'Very, very nice!', '2010-03-12 18:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901737, 859038, 112828, '<td valign="top">I hate it!  too much filter here!  :)</td>', 'I hate it!  too much filter here!  :)', '2010-03-12 18:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
