(5901739, 859239, 112828, '<td valign="top">hmm, I think this was a seriously missed opportunity, I was hoping to see some nude abstract forms...  No-one did that!</td>', 'hmm, I think this was a seriously missed opportunity, I was hoping to see some nude abstract forms...  No-one did that!', '2010-03-12 18:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901741, 858897, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not loving this one.  At all. :)</td>', 'Not loving this one.  At all. :)', '2010-03-12 18:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901742, 858959, 112828, '<td valign="top">There appears to be enough dirt to start a small farm on your sensor.<br/> <br/>Still an interesting image..  But, clean your sensor!</td>', 'There appears to be enough dirt to start a small farm on your sensor. Still an interesting image..  But, clean your sensor!', '2010-03-12 18:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901750, 859115, 93283, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, the figures remind of something from Renaissance art. I think it works well for this challenge, although I may have preferred to have the center face in focus. I wouldn''t know until I saw it, so, either way.... good shot 6</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, the figures remind of something from Renaissance art. I think it works well for this challenge, although I may have preferred to have the center face in focus. I wouldn''t know until I saw it, so, either way.... good shot 6', '2010-03-12 19:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901752, 858282, 93283, '<td valign="top">Black and White, but not desaturated... Hmmm... Think I saw someone mention this in the forums so I think I know who you are... Anyway, its a pretty interesting shot with allot of subtle things going on. I like the shapes that the lines form... 6</td>', 'Black and White, but not desaturated... Hmmm... Think I saw someone mention this in the forums so I think I know who you are... Anyway, its a pretty interesting shot with allot of subtle things going on. I like the shapes that the lines form... 6', '2010-03-12 19:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901754, 858802, 93283, '<td valign="top">Okay, I have bumped up allot of images on the third viewing, but I''m moving this from a 6 to an 8... Very interesting perspective, and the overall feel is powerful... This is a great Fine Arts entry!</td>', 'Okay, I have bumped up allot of images on the third viewing, but I''m moving this from a 6 to an 8... Very interesting perspective, and the overall feel is powerful... This is a great Fine Arts entry!', '2010-03-12 19:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901756, 858600, 93283, '<td valign="top">This photo has a nice mood to it. It definitely has an artistic feel to it. The birds and the person in the background are a nice touch, and the post-processing is perfect IMO... 7</td>', 'This photo has a nice mood to it. It definitely has an artistic feel to it. The birds and the person in the background are a nice touch, and the post-processing is perfect IMO... 7', '2010-03-12 19:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901760, 859187, 93283, '<td valign="top">Well done on creating a very interesting photo... What I really find fascinating about this photo is that the viewer can only image what that couple are talking about... I mean, it could be two friends, brother and sister, or husband and wife. He could be explaining why he cheated on her, or why he bought tickets to the Red Sox game... Anyway, its tells whatever story the viewer wants it to, so for that I commend you, and it fits very well in this challenge... 8</td>', 'Well done on creating a very interesting photo... What I really find fascinating about this photo is that the viewer can only image what that couple are talking about... I mean, it could be two friends, brother and sister, or husband and wife. He could be explaining why he cheated on her, or why he bought tickets to the Red Sox game... Anyway, its tells whatever story the viewer wants it to, so for that I commend you, and it fits very well in this challenge... 8', '2010-03-12 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901766, 859228, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but for me it feels incomplete. Perhaps if this was part of a still life series I''d feel differently but as a standalone image I am wanting more. I think the absurdity aspect could have been heighten. For example, include the assistant holding the reflector, the "grape stylist" waxing the grapes. In other words, take absurd to the absurd.</td>', 'Nice idea but for me it feels incomplete. Perhaps if this was part of a still life series I''d feel differently but as a standalone image I am wanting more. I think the absurdity aspect could have been heighten. For example, include the assistant holding the reflector, the "grape stylist" waxing the grapes. In other words, take absurd to the absurd.', '2010-03-12 19:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901769, 858694, 104230, '<td valign="top">Appropriate choice of high aspect ratio for this image. A very pleasing image. I find it simultaneously both calming and stimulating!</td>', 'Appropriate choice of high aspect ratio for this image. A very pleasing image. I find it simultaneously both calming and stimulating!', '2010-03-12 19:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901770, 859124, 104230, '<td valign="top">Evocative.  Interesting POV. I like this.</td>', 'Evocative.  Interesting POV. I like this.', '2010-03-12 19:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901796, 859248, 104230, '<td valign="top">This engages me emotionally. Well done. My thoughts on this are that swings are a wonderful metaphor for and reminder of childhood.  That remembered feeling of flying through the air without a care is a powerful one.  One that we can feel drawn back to.  Some aspects of the processing seem a bit ragged, but whether deliberately so or not I cannot tell, for example the dark halo around the hands and the transition area where the ground ends.</td>', 'This engages me emotionally. Well done. My thoughts on this are that swings are a wonderful metaphor for and reminder of childhood.  That remembered feeling of flying through the air without a care is a powerful one.  One that we can feel drawn back to.  Some aspects of the processing seem a bit ragged, but whether deliberately so or not I cannot tell, for example the dark halo around the hands and the transition area where the ground ends.', '2010-03-12 19:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901807, 858234, 41337, '<td valign="top">unearthly</td>', 'unearthly', '2010-03-12 19:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901810, 859242, 104230, '<td valign="top">This is visually interesting and I like the palette and sense of movement.  However, it does not engage me emotionally or intellectually and I am looking for one or the other in this fine art photography challenge.</td>', 'This is visually interesting and I like the palette and sense of movement.  However, it does not engage me emotionally or intellectually and I am looking for one or the other in this fine art photography challenge.', '2010-03-12 20:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901812, 858667, 41337, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but not a good title.</td>', 'Beautiful but not a good title.', '2010-03-12 20:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5901813, 859004, 50641, '<td valign="top">cute, reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">melethia</a>''s ''glad to see me?'' photo :)</td>', 'cute, reminds me of  melethia''s ''glad to see me?'' photo :)', '2010-03-12 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
