(5902146, 859081, 54645, '<td valign="top">Like the title, I don''t think the photograph needs it, the lines are compelling enough for me, even the tones could be richer and brighter, I like image. No message. Just shapes to enjoy.</td>', 'Like the title, I don''t think the photograph needs it, the lines are compelling enough for me, even the tones could be richer and brighter, I like image. No message. Just shapes to enjoy.', '2010-03-13 01:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
