(5902296, 859029, 64086, '<td valign="top">This is really great abstract picture. The composition is fantastic. The smoother, softer focus texture in the lower left gives a sense of depth and leads to and from the more precise, detailed shape towards the middle that is echoed right above it in lighter tones leading my eye in and out of the photo nicely. The open area on the right balances the composition perfectly. Great Job.</td>', 'This is really great abstract picture. The composition is fantastic. The smoother, softer focus texture in the lower left gives a sense of depth and leads to and from the more precise, detailed shape towards the middle that is echoed right above it in lighter tones leading my eye in and out of the photo nicely. The open area on the right balances the composition perfectly. Great Job.', '2010-03-13 06:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902302, 858536, 64086, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea and well done. I like how the left side of the photo(eye and lips) have greater clarity contrasting the foil distortions on the right side. My only minor criticism is that the composition seems just a tad off. Maybe a little tilt or small amount cropped off the right side, although I like the transition of dark to light on the right side.</td>', 'Beautiful idea and well done. I like how the left side of the photo(eye and lips) have greater clarity contrasting the foil distortions on the right side. My only minor criticism is that the composition seems just a tad off. Maybe a little tilt or small amount cropped off the right side, although I like the transition of dark to light on the right side.', '2010-03-13 07:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902310, 858525, 50695, '<td valign="top">Wow! A real pleasure not knowing what this is!</td>', 'Wow! A real pleasure not knowing what this is!', '2010-03-13 07:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
