(5902474, 859248, 76335, '<td valign="top">Intriguing in that it doesn''t tell the story to the viewer in one split second. Lots to take in and consider (and perhaps even criticize) here. And that''s art by my definition.</td>', 'Intriguing in that it doesn''t tell the story to the viewer in one split second. Lots to take in and consider (and perhaps even criticize) here. And that''s art by my definition.', '2010-03-13 11:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
