(5902529, 859228, 64086, '<td valign="top">This is incredible...the unusual sky, the bright desolate foreground, great lighting and a fascinating subject. My only minor criticism is that I would crop off a little on the left to make it more centered. That goes against my usual thought process, but when I cover the left 1/4 inch on my monitor, the photo seems to have even greater impact.</td>', 'This is incredible...the unusual sky, the bright desolate foreground, great lighting and a fascinating subject. My only minor criticism is that I would crop off a little on the left to make it more centered. That goes against my usual thought process, but when I cover the left 1/4 inch on my monitor, the photo seems to have even greater impact.', '2010-03-13 12:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902537, 858525, 64086, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is...but I think it''s fantastic. The composition is spot on. I love the fine detail, superb toning and how the upper right hand area echoes the circles in the lower right area with less detail and a greater sense of space.</td>', 'Not sure what it is...but I think it''s fantastic. The composition is spot on. I love the fine detail, superb toning and how the upper right hand area echoes the circles in the lower right area with less detail and a greater sense of space.', '2010-03-13 12:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902577, 859189, 32767, '<td valign="top">I think this will do very well in the voting but I see a lot of these juxtapostion shots that I don''t honestly understand. Top Hat''s, umbrellas, eggs, nudes, jumping fish, birds nests, old telephones, clocks etc. all placed together in frame... I need to know why?</td>', 'I think this will do very well in the voting but I see a lot of these juxtapostion shots that I don''t honestly understand. Top Hat''s, umbrellas, eggs, nudes, jumping fish, birds nests, old telephones, clocks etc. all placed together in frame... I need to know why?', '2010-03-13 13:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902580, 858913, 32767, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of these juxtapostion shots that I don''t honestly understand. Top Hat''s, umbrellas, eggs, nudes, jumping fish, birds nests, old telephones, clocks, dried flowers, leafless trees etc. all placed together in frame... I need to know why?</td>', 'I see a lot of these juxtapostion shots that I don''t honestly understand. Top Hat''s, umbrellas, eggs, nudes, jumping fish, birds nests, old telephones, clocks, dried flowers, leafless trees etc. all placed together in frame... I need to know why?', '2010-03-13 13:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
