(5902661, 859242, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the movement and the compositional balance.</td>', '7 - I like the movement and the compositional balance.', '2010-03-13 15:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902662, 858802, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grease is the word.</td>', 'Grease is the word.', '2010-03-13 15:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902664, 859124, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Definitely a nice feel to this, which is enforced by your title.  A few elements in the scene detract/distract my imagination though, i.e.: the blue pole(?) with yellow at the top, the ''busyness'' in some parts, the windsock in front of the sign (fairly minor) and while also fairly minor, the slight tilt I just find distracts.</td>', '7 - Definitely a nice feel to this, which is enforced by your title.  A few elements in the scene detract/distract my imagination though, i.e.: the blue pole(?) with yellow at the top, the ''busyness'' in some parts, the windsock in front of the sign (fairly minor) and while also fairly minor, the slight tilt I just find distracts.', '2010-03-13 15:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902666, 859108, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice movement/texture abstract, I like the colors, but wonder about more saturation or hue - but that''s just personal preference - not my call.  A more refined crop, especially bottom left, to eliminate distractions, make it even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice movement/texture abstract, I like the colors, but wonder about more saturation or hue - but that''s just personal preference - not my call.  A more refined crop, especially bottom left, to eliminate distractions, make it even better in my opinion.', '2010-03-13 15:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902667, 859145, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the concept, would like to see more of the ''hand painting'' (OOF fore berries/hips on hand) and perhaps a less ''horizontal framing'' - just seems unbalanced, especially with the thumb/left side of the image, if you''re keeping the fingertips in - but your call.</td>', '7 - Like the concept, would like to see more of the ''hand painting'' (OOF fore berries/hips on hand) and perhaps a less ''horizontal framing'' - just seems unbalanced, especially with the thumb/left side of the image, if you''re keeping the fingertips in - but your call.', '2010-03-13 15:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902668, 859035, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the simplicity, the lines, curves, seemingly color on b&amp;w aspect - given the image as is, perhaps the grass either sharper or softer for added effect - also does seem slightly unbalanced overall, whether because of the crop at the bottom and/or the amount of sky - not sure.</td>', '7 - Like the simplicity, the lines, curves, seemingly color on b&w aspect - given the image as is, perhaps the grass either sharper or softer for added effect - also does seem slightly unbalanced overall, whether because of the crop at the bottom and/or the amount of sky - not sure.', '2010-03-13 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902671, 858236, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the texture that is visible and would like to see more of it, especially on both sides of the frame.</td>', '7 - Like the texture that is visible and would like to see more of it, especially on both sides of the frame.', '2010-03-13 15:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902674, 859081, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the quirkiness, but overall seems a little ''dull'', color/tonewise.  The perspective seems slightly tilted too.</td>', '7 - I like the quirkiness, but overall seems a little ''dull'', color/tonewise.  The perspective seems slightly tilted too.', '2010-03-13 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902677, 859252, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Personal preference, but I like this better with just the neck and head.</td>', '7 - Personal preference, but I like this better with just the neck and head.', '2010-03-13 16:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902679, 857856, 83313, '<td valign="top">Observation, consideration, vote &amp; comment ---- (Modern Realism) {minimal feedback}</td>', 'Observation, consideration, vote & comment ---- (Modern Realism) {minimal feedback}', '2010-03-13 16:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902680, 858525, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I like this and, even though you''ve pushed things in pp (even just by negative, not sure) - one of the things I like most in the image are the details in the plant(?) - I want to see more - have them a fraction more discernible.  I guess you flipped, mirrored, etc - is this strongest like this? - don''t know, but it leaves me wondering.  Up to 8 from 7.</td>', '8 - I like this and, even though you''ve pushed things in pp (even just by negative, not sure) - one of the things I like most in the image are the details in the plant(?) - I want to see more - have them a fraction more discernible.  I guess you flipped, mirrored, etc - is this strongest like this? - don''t know, but it leaves me wondering.  Up to 8 from 7.', '2010-03-13 16:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902684, 859004, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the subject and for me, the beauty of the little scene and the light, are what appeal most and bring this closer to ''art'', however I don''t think the full potential has been reached.  I also am distracted by the OOF fore on the left and the dark/black areas in the rear.</td>', '6 - I like the subject and for me, the beauty of the little scene and the light, are what appeal most and bring this closer to ''art'', however I don''t think the full potential has been reached.  I also am distracted by the OOF fore on the left and the dark/black areas in the rear.', '2010-03-13 16:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902686, 859129, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the abstractness and the colors - can''t help but wondering about focussing on a more interesting area of the image, i.e.: a tighter crop and even more abstract, if the quality was there (and maybe even if it wasn''t).</td>', '7 - I like the abstractness and the colors - can''t help but wondering about focussing on a more interesting area of the image, i.e.: a tighter crop and even more abstract, if the quality was there (and maybe even if it wasn''t).', '2010-03-13 16:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902688, 859023, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog see hunting party return. No blood on spears, no mammoth for tribe. Will have to eat Thag''s tree bark casserole again. Grog is kind. Tells Thag cooking is delish.</td>', 'Grog see hunting party return. No blood on spears, no mammoth for tribe. Will have to eat Thag''s tree bark casserole again. Grog is kind. Tells Thag cooking is delish.', '2010-03-13 16:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902689, 859064, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very touching.</td>', 'Very touching.', '2010-03-13 16:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902690, 857976, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the scene and, before seeing your title, didn''t like that he/she was looking out of frame... still undecided.  A shame not a fraction sharper on the bird (or maybe more blurred, who knows), but also wish the silhouette was ''full'', that is the head not in front of the background.  More detail/definition in the carcass(es) and bones would be better, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - I like the scene and, before seeing your title, didn''t like that he/she was looking out of frame... still undecided.  A shame not a fraction sharper on the bird (or maybe more blurred, who knows), but also wish the silhouette was ''full'', that is the head not in front of the background.  More detail/definition in the carcass(es) and bones would be better, in my opinion.', '2010-03-13 16:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902691, 858862, 83313, '<td valign="top">Might be enough to make me start smoking.</td>', 'Might be enough to make me start smoking.', '2010-03-13 16:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902692, 859197, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the simplicity and natural colors - little distractions, like ethe one to the left of the end pier/dock gone, make it better in my opinion, especially for this Challenge.</td>', '7 - I like the simplicity and natural colors - little distractions, like ethe one to the left of the end pier/dock gone, make it better in my opinion, especially for this Challenge.', '2010-03-13 16:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902693, 859025, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the sweeping/swaying nature of the flower and that the anthers are still ''intact''.  Don''t like the broken leaf and the vase detracts from the ''vision'' that you put in my mind with the image from your (good) title and the flower.</td>', '7 - I like the sweeping/swaying nature of the flower and that the anthers are still ''intact''.  Don''t like the broken leaf and the vase detracts from the ''vision'' that you put in my mind with the image from your (good) title and the flower.', '2010-03-13 16:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902698, 858600, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I <i>do</i> really like this - the feel of being there, the feel <i>within</i> the scene but, and I know you might not get this, the distant figure''s clothing, including color/style, detracts, for me.  Up to 8 from 7 as it does appeal - but mostly everything but the figure.  Had they been in different clothes/the tones changed, who knows - but either way, just sharing my thoughts and vote with you.</td>', '8 - I do really like this - the feel of being there, the feel within the scene but, and I know you might not get this, the distant figure''s clothing, including color/style, detracts, for me.  Up to 8 from 7 as it does appeal - but mostly everything but the figure.  Had they been in different clothes/the tones changed, who knows - but either way, just sharing my thoughts and vote with you.', '2010-03-13 16:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902699, 859159, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like this, however the colors somewhat muted, doesn''t pack the punch I think this would with a bump here and there in pp.. but personal preference.</td>', '7 - I like this, however the colors somewhat muted, doesn''t pack the punch I think this would with a bump here and there in pp.. but personal preference.', '2010-03-13 16:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902700, 858775, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice flip (being presumptious) - my eye wants to see it straightened.  I like the tones.</td>', '7 - Nice flip (being presumptious) - my eye wants to see it straightened.  I like the tones.', '2010-03-13 16:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902703, 859217, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the choice of subject, but find the OOF flower, but in the composition as is, a little distracting.  I also wonder about some diffusing of the light to minimize/eliminate the hotspots, all be them subtle.  Compositionally, I think the lower part of the image is the strongest.</td>', '6 - I like the choice of subject, but find the OOF flower, but in the composition as is, a little distracting.  I also wonder about some diffusing of the light to minimize/eliminate the hotspots, all be them subtle.  Compositionally, I think the lower part of the image is the strongest.', '2010-03-13 16:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902705, 859227, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the simplicity - wish it were ''straight''.</td>', '6 - I like the simplicity - wish it were ''straight''.', '2010-03-13 16:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902707, 858834, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the composition and balance, good framing/crop choice.  I just don''t find much to hold my interest within the image/a scene like this.</td>', '6 - I like the composition and balance, good framing/crop choice.  I just don''t find much to hold my interest within the image/a scene like this.', '2010-03-13 16:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902708, 858968, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - It is beautiful and I do like your colors and the strength of them.  I find the upper right red throws the balance out too much though... especially for such a deliberate abstract.</td>', '6 - It is beautiful and I do like your colors and the strength of them.  I find the upper right red throws the balance out too much though... especially for such a deliberate abstract.', '2010-03-13 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902711, 859100, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like this, but wonder about more potential with a more refined crop.</td>', '6 - I like this, but wonder about more potential with a more refined crop.', '2010-03-13 16:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902717, 858913, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the effort, but it is not strange enough (I know) for me - as in, looks too staged, maybe a much bolder crop on the left, to eliminate ''normality'', who knows.  The compositional balance is also out - what with that lonely lamp on its own on the right there and all.  I like that element.  Fairly minor, but there seems to need a whisker nudge up on the left.</td>', '6 - I like the effort, but it is not strange enough (I know) for me - as in, looks too staged, maybe a much bolder crop on the left, to eliminate ''normality'', who knows.  The compositional balance is also out - what with that lonely lamp on its own on the right there and all.  I like that element.  Fairly minor, but there seems to need a whisker nudge up on the left.', '2010-03-13 16:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902719, 858719, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice feel, nice light, nice colors, nice moment, nice title - seeing the distant figures far right takes me back to reality though... A slightly more refined crop at the fore/bottom too, make it stronger in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice feel, nice light, nice colors, nice moment, nice title - seeing the distant figures far right takes me back to reality though... A slightly more refined crop at the fore/bottom too, make it stronger in my opinion.', '2010-03-13 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902724, 859204, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I think you won''t like this comment, but it seems, visually, like it needs a nudge up on the right to straighten, even for a visual balance.  However then the seemingly ''chopped'' right hand side would be further accentuated.  I especially like the flick up of water down center right.</td>', '6 - I think you won''t like this comment, but it seems, visually, like it needs a nudge up on the right to straighten, even for a visual balance.  However then the seemingly ''chopped'' right hand side would be further accentuated.  I especially like the flick up of water down center right.', '2010-03-13 16:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902728, 859027, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Looks weird enough to warrant ''art'' but wonder about either more extreme processing and/or trying to minimize the ''self portrait''/home shot feel to this.</td>', '6 - Looks weird enough to warrant ''art'' but wonder about either more extreme processing and/or trying to minimize the ''self portrait''/home shot feel to this.', '2010-03-13 16:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902730, 859183, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the blur effect, but a more refined crop and some tweaking with contrast/something make this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - I like the blur effect, but a more refined crop and some tweaking with contrast/something make this better in my opinion.', '2010-03-13 16:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902731, 858906, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the texture and detail discernible - would like to see more.  Compositionally, it seems unbalanced, also seems tilted slightly.  I like the tones &amp; light.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - I like the texture and detail discernible - would like to see more.  Compositionally, it seems unbalanced, also seems tilted slightly.  I like the tones & light.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2010-03-13 16:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902744, 858932, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Maybe it is because of the size constraints, but I wish I could decipher what that orange/yellow thing is.  Otherwise, I like the tones and wish this had a little more of a dreamy/fantasy feel overall.</td>', '6 - Maybe it is because of the size constraints, but I wish I could decipher what that orange/yellow thing is.  Otherwise, I like the tones and wish this had a little more of a dreamy/fantasy feel overall.', '2010-03-13 16:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902748, 858744, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the subject and the shadow element, but wish it were more defined/sharper and the composition slightly different - the angle of the shadow and the angle of the leaf/veined thing (might be a pod), just isn''t sitting well - despite the good darker corners to try to balance it out.  I quite like your framing too.  Just seems out, somehow, but may be different on a different medium/larger.</td>', '6 - I like the subject and the shadow element, but wish it were more defined/sharper and the composition slightly different - the angle of the shadow and the angle of the leaf/veined thing (might be a pod), just isn''t sitting well - despite the good darker corners to try to balance it out.  I quite like your framing too.  Just seems out, somehow, but may be different on a different medium/larger.', '2010-03-13 16:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902750, 857967, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the colors, the abstractness, the transparency and even the framing - hard to explain, but it seems a little harsh - might be that black area.</td>', '6 - I like the colors, the abstractness, the transparency and even the framing - hard to explain, but it seems a little harsh - might be that black area.', '2010-03-13 16:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902751, 858945, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Quite a classic, and you found a bicycle with some character.  I wish it were not chopped on the right and compositionally a little variation.</td>', '6 - Quite a classic, and you found a bicycle with some character.  I wish it were not chopped on the right and compositionally a little variation.', '2010-03-13 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902754, 859096, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the feel, the mist, the colors, the perspective, the focal points - for me the elements of the picnic are ''off''.  But that is just a personal perception thing, i.e.: apple and beer..  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - I like the feel, the mist, the colors, the perspective, the focal points - for me the elements of the picnic are ''off''.  But that is just a personal perception thing, i.e.: apple and beer..  Up to 7 from 6.', '2010-03-13 17:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902755, 859189, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like that you''ve gone for oddness, but it is not quite odd enough and doesn''t pack enough pp punch, in my opinion.  The focal points also detract.</td>', '6 - I like that you''ve gone for oddness, but it is not quite odd enough and doesn''t pack enough pp punch, in my opinion.  The focal points also detract.', '2010-03-13 17:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902758, 859064, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the tones and the composition is quite good - but I am distracted by the funky frame on the right.</td>', '6 - I like the tones and the composition is quite good - but I am distracted by the funky frame on the right.', '2010-03-13 17:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902759, 858802, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the concept, but the composition seems unbalanced - book needs to be a little more dominant in my opinion - but the size constraints might be working against this.</td>', '6 - I like the concept, but the composition seems unbalanced - book needs to be a little more dominant in my opinion - but the size constraints might be working against this.', '2010-03-13 17:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902760, 859176, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - It is odd, but not pushed to the extreme it needs to be, in my opinion.  What I get of the concept, I don''t personally find appealing.</td>', '6 - It is odd, but not pushed to the extreme it needs to be, in my opinion.  What I get of the concept, I don''t personally find appealing.', '2010-03-13 17:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902762, 859169, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the framing/composition and the colors are quite nice, but I wonder how much of the image is a literal representation of existing art by another artist.</td>', '6 - Like the framing/composition and the colors are quite nice, but I wonder how much of the image is a literal representation of existing art by another artist.', '2010-03-13 17:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902765, 859162, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like this concept, but find the hand dominates too much, as does, perhaps, the background.</td>', '6 - I like this concept, but find the hand dominates too much, as does, perhaps, the background.', '2010-03-13 17:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902766, 858883, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like this, but does feel unfinished crop/framing wise, especially at the top left.</td>', '6 - I like this, but does feel unfinished crop/framing wise, especially at the top left.', '2010-03-13 17:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902770, 859251, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - A more refined crop top right make this better in my opinion.  The trouble when people put ''symmetry'' in their title, is my eye becomes even more critical looking for it - especially in an image such as this.</td>', '6 - A more refined crop top right make this better in my opinion.  The trouble when people put ''symmetry'' in their title, is my eye becomes even more critical looking for it - especially in an image such as this.', '2010-03-13 17:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902774, 859223, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I like the concept and the visual trickery.  Up to 7 from 6.  Actually, despite wondering (and I''m not) about further potential with pp or cropping, it''s tricky enough that I am going up to 8.  It is original in this Challenge and a form of art, in an odd and unique sense.</td>', '8 - I like the concept and the visual trickery.  Up to 7 from 6.  Actually, despite wondering (and I''m not) about further potential with pp or cropping, it''s tricky enough that I am going up to 8.  It is original in this Challenge and a form of art, in an odd and unique sense.', '2010-03-13 17:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902782, 859122, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Don''t mind the concept, my eyes wanted to see the ''eyes'' more ''eye level'' on first look, and this second look, same thing.  Also, a more refined crop (especially to lose some of the hair) to accentuate those elements make it even better in my opinion.  I also like the ''feathered crown''.</td>', '6 - Don''t mind the concept, my eyes wanted to see the ''eyes'' more ''eye level'' on first look, and this second look, same thing.  Also, a more refined crop (especially to lose some of the hair) to accentuate those elements make it even better in my opinion.  I also like the ''feathered crown''.', '2010-03-13 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902785, 858654, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Yes, a bit odd - the ol'' gas mask, whilst not exclusive to certain artists, is a bit cliche for me.  The quality of the image is good and seemingly studio set up makes for good lighting etc - but, I don''t know, personal preference I guess - the style just doesn''t appeal to me much these days.</td>', '6 - Yes, a bit odd - the ol'' gas mask, whilst not exclusive to certain artists, is a bit cliche for me.  The quality of the image is good and seemingly studio set up makes for good lighting etc - but, I don''t know, personal preference I guess - the style just doesn''t appeal to me much these days.', '2010-03-13 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902796, 859057, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like this, especially the unusual disappearance of the vase (or is it the vase) - however, I prefer ''life'' as the main focus and therefore want it to be on the right hand side and/or dominating the image more.  I like that the visual matches your title, left side right side... but still..</td>', '6 - I like this, especially the unusual disappearance of the vase (or is it the vase) - however, I prefer ''life'' as the main focus and therefore want it to be on the right hand side and/or dominating the image more.  I like that the visual matches your title, left side right side... but still..', '2010-03-13 17:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902798, 858808, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the little scene, but the sign isn''t doing much for me in the image.</td>', '6 - I like the little scene, but the sign isn''t doing much for me in the image.', '2010-03-13 17:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902801, 859123, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice feel, more shadow playing in the image would be good - and perhaps a variation in composition/crop - but your call.</td>', '6 - Nice feel, more shadow playing in the image would be good - and perhaps a variation in composition/crop - but your call.', '2010-03-13 17:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902805, 859213, 35334, '<td valign="top">The quiet scene has been shattered by a cannon blast of flowers. Nice.</td>', 'The quiet scene has been shattered by a cannon blast of flowers. Nice.', '2010-03-13 17:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902807, 857870, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - A little more clarity on the flower, don''t know, as is on the ''thing'' at the fore.. I don''t know what to focus on.  The composition is nice...</td>', '6 - A little more clarity on the flower, don''t know, as is on the ''thing'' at the fore.. I don''t know what to focus on.  The composition is nice...', '2010-03-13 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5902809, 858485, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the concept - perhaps a little more definition...</td>', '6 - I like the concept - perhaps a little more definition...', '2010-03-13 17:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902811, 859023, 35334, '<td valign="top">We are lost in a frozen wasteland, following each other to nowhere. Nice.</td>', 'We are lost in a frozen wasteland, following each other to nowhere. Nice.', '2010-03-13 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902813, 859030, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I like the simplicity and your composition (although wonder about a fraction more off the right, but your call of course), undecided on the frame - whether it is enhancing, especially at this size.</td>', '6 - I like the simplicity and your composition (although wonder about a fraction more off the right, but your call of course), undecided on the frame - whether it is enhancing, especially at this size.', '2010-03-13 17:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902814, 858968, 35334, '<td valign="top">The shapes and colors are very suggestive.Nice.</td>', 'The shapes and colors are very suggestive.Nice.', '2010-03-13 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902816, 859028, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice and simple but I find the background dominates/distracts too much.</td>', '6 - Nice and simple but I find the background dominates/distracts too much.', '2010-03-13 17:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902820, 859022, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Wish we could see the boys a little more and the distractions at the top of the building were somehow minimized (cropped maybe).</td>', '6 - Wish we could see the boys a little more and the distractions at the top of the building were somehow minimized (cropped maybe).', '2010-03-13 17:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902838, 859054, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - More potential in my opinion - cropping or rather, possible ''pruning/picking off'' some of the flowers to have no/less distractions from ''choppedness''... if you follow, to truly showcase the simple beauty (albeit in a tampered with &amp; unnatural way) .</td>', '6 - More potential in my opinion - cropping or rather, possible ''pruning/picking off'' some of the flowers to have no/less distractions from ''choppedness''... if you follow, to truly showcase the simple beauty (albeit in a tampered with & unnatural way) .', '2010-03-13 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902862, 858917, 71536, '<td valign="top">Gleason Art.  Nice Job.</td>', 'Gleason Art.  Nice Job.', '2010-03-13 18:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902873, 858913, 71536, '<td valign="top">Python art. Hmmm....</td>', 'Python art. Hmmm....', '2010-03-13 18:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902902, 859023, 76335, '<td valign="top">Another instant ten. Beautifully conceived -- very artisitic.</td>', 'Another instant ten. Beautifully conceived -- very artisitic.', '2010-03-13 19:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902908, 859221, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good potential here, but for me, needs a variation in composition and/or cropping - much bolder/stronger.</td>', '6 - Good potential here, but for me, needs a variation in composition and/or cropping - much bolder/stronger.', '2010-03-13 19:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
