(5902987, 859027, 56744, '<td valign="top">I voted this challenge for the only reason I could give a 10 to this image. Everything is perfect and it''s a great example of how a fine art photograph should be.</td>', 'I voted this challenge for the only reason I could give a 10 to this image. Everything is perfect and it''s a great example of how a fine art photograph should be.', '2010-03-13 22:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902988, 858813, 56744, '<td valign="top">Yes! A great example of artistic expression and execution. This really is a work that can be at any gallery side by side with the best ones. I wish people can see and recognize the beauty on this photograph.</td>', 'Yes! A great example of artistic expression and execution. This really is a work that can be at any gallery side by side with the best ones. I wish people can see and recognize the beauty on this photograph.', '2010-03-13 22:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902989, 859023, 56744, '<td valign="top">This is the case where less is more. Simple, balance and a perfect composition.</td>', 'This is the case where less is more. Simple, balance and a perfect composition.', '2010-03-13 22:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902990, 859204, 56744, '<td valign="top">Ok, I think I know where this image came from. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ursula</a> I guess. Technique is amazing, composition and colors are at a Master level. It''s not easy and it''s not for all controling art at this level. God bless you for the pleasure emanating from your work. IMO when God give us the hability to do things in a superior way, we should return Him with something really special. It''s not the first time that I felt this, and once again it came to my mind. I wish this amazing artist would chose other subjects than just beauty. 9</td>', 'Ok, I think I know where this image came from.  ursula I guess. Technique is amazing, composition and colors are at a Master level. It''s not easy and it''s not for all controling art at this level. God bless you for the pleasure emanating from your work. IMO when God give us the hability to do things in a superior way, we should return Him with something really special. It''s not the first time that I felt this, and once again it came to my mind. I wish this amazing artist would chose other subjects than just beauty. 9', '2010-03-13 22:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5902991, 858719, 56744, '<td valign="top">Composition and colors are superb. I really feel art in this image. Congrats for the great job.</td>', 'Composition and colors are superb. I really feel art in this image. Congrats for the great job.', '2010-03-13 22:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
