(5903007, 858956, 93283, '<td valign="top">I like the lens baby effect... The colors and border look good too. This photo gives me the effect of being driven into a Jackson Pollock piece at 150MPH... I like it, makes me think..&gt; Well done!</td>', 'I like the lens baby effect... The colors and border look good too. This photo gives me the effect of being driven into a Jackson Pollock piece at 150MPH... I like it, makes me think..> Well done!', '2010-03-13 22:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903008, 859254, 93283, '<td valign="top">Twisted and funky.. Makes you look more than twice, and that''s why I like it... Fine art... Definitely</td>', 'Twisted and funky.. Makes you look more than twice, and that''s why I like it... Fine art... Definitely', '2010-03-13 22:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903010, 858315, 93283, '<td valign="top">I like the overall mood and feel of this shot... The illumination of the three strings works well too... I think personally it may have worked alittle better for me if the guitar was either level, or tilted more harshly, but that''s just me... It definitely works for this challenge, nice shot</td>', 'I like the overall mood and feel of this shot... The illumination of the three strings works well too... I think personally it may have worked alittle better for me if the guitar was either level, or tilted more harshly, but that''s just me... It definitely works for this challenge, nice shot', '2010-03-13 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903014, 858932, 93283, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot... The focus is what really makes it in my opinion... Nice contrast with the black shirt and colorful flying bug... Interesting shot that works well in this challenge... Well done!</td>', 'I really like this shot... The focus is what really makes it in my opinion... Nice contrast with the black shirt and colorful flying bug... Interesting shot that works well in this challenge... Well done!', '2010-03-13 22:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
