(5903019, 858793, 93283, '<td valign="top">Lots of negative space, but its a cool effect... I like this shot... leaves some things to the imagination, and that''s what really works for it... Well done</td>', 'Lots of negative space, but its a cool effect... I like this shot... leaves some things to the imagination, and that''s what really works for it... Well done', '2010-03-13 22:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903020, 859212, 93283, '<td valign="top">Jammin out to Linkin Park and stumbling across this image, I''m totally lost in it... Very cool effect and definitely an example of Fine Art... 7</td>', 'Jammin out to Linkin Park and stumbling across this image, I''m totally lost in it... Very cool effect and definitely an example of Fine Art... 7', '2010-03-13 22:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903022, 859097, 93283, '<td valign="top">Love it and I don''t know why... but that''s how art works.. I have come across a few images in this challenge that I can just get lost in, and this is one of them... I don''t know why I like it, but I just do.. .and that''s enough for me... well done! 8</td>', 'Love it and I don''t know why... but that''s how art works.. I have come across a few images in this challenge that I can just get lost in, and this is one of them... I don''t know why I like it, but I just do.. .and that''s enough for me... well done! 8', '2010-03-13 22:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
