(5903025, 857872, 93283, '<td valign="top">Okay, this one is just out there... and that''s really cool... This image is unique from the others, and that''s why I like it... Any image that makes me stop and say, "WHOOAAA...", gets bonus points... Very cool shot that works well for this challenge...</td>', 'Okay, this one is just out there... and that''s really cool... This image is unique from the others, and that''s why I like it... Any image that makes me stop and say, "WHOOAAA...", gets bonus points... Very cool shot that works well for this challenge...', '2010-03-13 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903027, 859118, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like this, wish he/she popped a fraction more (even though there is good pop now) - a more refined crop at the bottom too.  Personal preference, but either the sat (especially on the eye) up a bit weirder or otherwise down, as the background colors are competing too much for attention, maybe - not sure.  Also wish there was a little more room ''above''.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - I like this, wish he/she popped a fraction more (even though there is good pop now) - a more refined crop at the bottom too.  Personal preference, but either the sat (especially on the eye) up a bit weirder or otherwise down, as the background colors are competing too much for attention, maybe - not sure.  Also wish there was a little more room ''above''.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2010-03-13 22:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
