(5903045, 858600, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love it! (even without the title). Nice job bringing out the woodwinds.<br/>Maybe the conductor could be just a little closer so we could see him (okay that''s a joke). Even the branches could be like the strings on the violins playing way up high over everybody else. Now let''s see.... which symphony did you say they were playing? Great job (did I say that part yet).</td>', 'Love it! (even without the title). Nice job bringing out the woodwinds.Maybe the conductor could be just a little closer so we could see him (okay that''s a joke). Even the branches could be like the strings on the violins playing way up high over everybody else. Now let''s see.... which symphony did you say they were playing? Great job (did I say that part yet).', '2010-03-13 22:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
