(5903500, 859138, 113278, '<td valign="top">Man, I missed some real gems the first run through. I didn''t give my original vote on this much thought but seeing it again I really like it. Even though it is a photo of a flower, which DPC has many of in most challenges, I feel as though the way you composed this with the colors and blur and all really fits the theme of this challenge well. Bumping your score upward, good luck.</td>', 'Man, I missed some real gems the first run through. I didn''t give my original vote on this much thought but seeing it again I really like it. Even though it is a photo of a flower, which DPC has many of in most challenges, I feel as though the way you composed this with the colors and blur and all really fits the theme of this challenge well. Bumping your score upward, good luck.', '2010-03-14 09:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903501, 858600, 114285, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.</td>', 'Brilliant.', '2010-03-14 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903502, 858492, 68769, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture..</td>', 'Very nice capture..', '2010-03-14 09:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903503, 859064, 113278, '<td valign="top">Love this. Great dramatic clouds with the simple branches that seem to be reaching upward.</td>', 'Love this. Great dramatic clouds with the simple branches that seem to be reaching upward.', '2010-03-14 09:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903504, 859204, 113278, '<td valign="top">Love this. Love the texture with the great colors in there. This one I could see on my wall, if I had a space of course. Good luck.</td>', 'Love this. Love the texture with the great colors in there. This one I could see on my wall, if I had a space of course. Good luck.', '2010-03-14 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903505, 858665, 113278, '<td valign="top">Ah, yet another low vote of mine that I am going to bump up. Not real sure what I was thinking the first run through but this is kind of neat. It has some good lighting and contrast as well as many neat textures and patterns. Good luck.</td>', 'Ah, yet another low vote of mine that I am going to bump up. Not real sure what I was thinking the first run through but this is kind of neat. It has some good lighting and contrast as well as many neat textures and patterns. Good luck.', '2010-03-14 09:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903506, 859033, 113278, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and interesting comp but it doesn''t fit (my personal definition) as Fine art. Good luck and hopefully it is just me.<br/> <br/>ETA, again I am reviewing shots I have looked over and over and after really thinking about it I could see a modern art feel to this. So the score is going up some from me.</td>', 'Great lighting and interesting comp but it doesn''t fit (my personal definition) as Fine art. Good luck and hopefully it is just me. ETA, again I am reviewing shots I have looked over and over and after really thinking about it I could see a modern art feel to this. So the score is going up some from me.', '2010-03-14 09:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903507, 859131, 113278, '<td valign="top">First time through I saw this and just figured you took a shot of a wall and didn''t put much thought into it. Maybe that is what you did but as I spend more time on it I get a cool modern art vibe from it.Perhaps I am just looking to much into it and imagining things that really aren''t there but isn''t that what art is? At least a little bit anyway. Regardless your score is getting bumped up, good luck.</td>', 'First time through I saw this and just figured you took a shot of a wall and didn''t put much thought into it. Maybe that is what you did but as I spend more time on it I get a cool modern art vibe from it.Perhaps I am just looking to much into it and imagining things that really aren''t there but isn''t that what art is? At least a little bit anyway. Regardless your score is getting bumped up, good luck.', '2010-03-14 09:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903508, 859187, 68769, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to this, great capture..</td>', 'Nice feel to this, great capture..', '2010-03-14 09:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
