(5903587, 859225, 76335, '<td valign="top">One gets the felling that she''s been in that position a long time (years). Bizarre and disturbing. Good work.</td>', 'One gets the felling that she''s been in that position a long time (years). Bizarre and disturbing. Good work.', '2010-03-14 10:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
