(5903899, 858563, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the concept, but the image in the mirror doesn''t gel with the title or my imagination - the composition and background also detracts, in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the concept, but the image in the mirror doesn''t gel with the title or my imagination - the composition and background also detracts, in my opinion.', '2010-03-14 15:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903901, 858912, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - I nearly missed the photograph on first look when initially voting - dried roses are a little cliche for me, overall the composition doesn''t seem deliberate.</td>', '3 - I nearly missed the photograph on first look when initially voting - dried roses are a little cliche for me, overall the composition doesn''t seem deliberate.', '2010-03-14 15:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903905, 859097, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - It is subtle, and perhaps I''d see more if I lingered for longer, but I''m not - nothing is drawing me in strong enough.  I do like the woman bending over bottom left though.</td>', '4 - It is subtle, and perhaps I''d see more if I lingered for longer, but I''m not - nothing is drawing me in strong enough.  I do like the woman bending over bottom left though.', '2010-03-14 15:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903907, 858954, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - The perspective tilt isn''t adding to the composition and framing, in my opinion.</td>', '4 - The perspective tilt isn''t adding to the composition and framing, in my opinion.', '2010-03-14 15:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903910, 858234, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - This likely appeals to many, but not for me.  Quite like the effect though, but the crop/composition doesn''t seem strong enough.</td>', '3 - This likely appeals to many, but not for me.  Quite like the effect though, but the crop/composition doesn''t seem strong enough.', '2010-03-14 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903911, 858467, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - I like the potential, but a much bolder crop/framing make this feel more like art for me.  The border shuts it all in too much too, in my opinion.</td>', '4 - I like the potential, but a much bolder crop/framing make this feel more like art for me.  The border shuts it all in too much too, in my opinion.', '2010-03-14 15:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903914, 859125, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Not really doing much for me, the crop isn''t drawing me into the scene and the distractions that I see within it at the fore, don''t really make me want to explore.</td>', '4 - Not really doing much for me, the crop isn''t drawing me into the scene and the distractions that I see within it at the fore, don''t really make me want to explore.', '2010-03-14 15:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903917, 859225, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Cliche and not weird enough for me, maybe if you pushed the concept to an extreme, who knows - the left side floor panel and wall line detract.</td>', '3 - Cliche and not weird enough for me, maybe if you pushed the concept to an extreme, who knows - the left side floor panel and wall line detract.', '2010-03-14 15:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903919, 859143, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Don''t mind the blur, but the crop and finished feel to the image seems to need more refining.</td>', '4 - Don''t mind the blur, but the crop and finished feel to the image seems to need more refining.', '2010-03-14 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903920, 859029, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Somewhat interesting horizontal framing choice - I find the left lower OOF object too distracting.</td>', '4 - Somewhat interesting horizontal framing choice - I find the left lower OOF object too distracting.', '2010-03-14 15:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903925, 859088, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Shadows too subtle and the mix of grain - isn''t really enhancing this or making any real statement, the glass is chopped and also tilted and the reflections on it, cropped as is, don''t bring anything to the image.</td>', '3 - Shadows too subtle and the mix of grain - isn''t really enhancing this or making any real statement, the glass is chopped and also tilted and the reflections on it, cropped as is, don''t bring anything to the image.', '2010-03-14 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903927, 857872, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Like the concept, somehow the composition feels wrong though.  Up to 5 from 4.</td>', '5 - Like the concept, somehow the composition feels wrong though.  Up to 5 from 4.', '2010-03-14 15:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903930, 859066, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Quite like the feel and processing, but wonder about a variation in placement during set up.</td>', '4 - Quite like the feel and processing, but wonder about a variation in placement during set up.', '2010-03-14 15:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903931, 858297, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - The colors aren''t enhancing the image in my opinion and for me, this is twofold literal/artistic representation.  The drip is good.</td>', '3 - The colors aren''t enhancing the image in my opinion and for me, this is twofold literal/artistic representation.  The drip is good.', '2010-03-14 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903932, 859135, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Like the concept, wish the composition was stronger and the effect also.</td>', '3 - Like the concept, wish the composition was stronger and the effect also.', '2010-03-14 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903934, 859244, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Too busy and non interesting for me.</td>', '3 - Too busy and non interesting for me.', '2010-03-14 15:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903936, 858959, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - The horizon...</td>', '3 - The horizon...', '2010-03-14 15:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903938, 858395, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - A little cliche for me and nothing making any real call for my attention.  I quite like that she is looking out of frame though, but wonder about exploring that more, maybe.  Up to 4 from 3.</td>', '4 - A little cliche for me and nothing making any real call for my attention.  I quite like that she is looking out of frame though, but wonder about exploring that more, maybe.  Up to 4 from 3.', '2010-03-14 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903939, 859177, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Both your title and the way you have processed this, including composition and tilt, isn''t saying ''art'' to me.</td>', '3 - Both your title and the way you have processed this, including composition and tilt, isn''t saying ''art'' to me.', '2010-03-14 15:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903940, 859166, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - It''s clean - but too cliche and not my taste.</td>', '3 - It''s clean - but too cliche and not my taste.', '2010-03-14 15:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903942, 859078, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Interesting head of hair and little nails - stronger with more off the top in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Interesting head of hair and little nails - stronger with more off the top in my opinion.', '2010-03-14 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903943, 859168, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - The processing isn''t enhancing this in my opinion.</td>', '3 - The processing isn''t enhancing this in my opinion.', '2010-03-14 15:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903945, 858890, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Has a snapshot feel to it, I like the look but going out of frame, which doesn''t seem purposeful, somehow.  The tilt of the floor is distracting.  I think there is potential here though and this, for me, is another image that would be much stronger with further processing, somehow.</td>', '3 - Has a snapshot feel to it, I like the look but going out of frame, which doesn''t seem purposeful, somehow.  The tilt of the floor is distracting.  I think there is potential here though and this, for me, is another image that would be much stronger with further processing, somehow.', '2010-03-14 15:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903946, 859250, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - There''s too many distractions in the image for me to concentrate fully on 4286 4286.</td>', '3 - There''s too many distractions in the image for me to concentrate fully on 4286 4286.', '2010-03-14 15:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903947, 858862, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Seems amateurish and well, a take on an older style, kind of.  The cigar lit might pack a little more punch, who knows.</td>', '3 - Seems amateurish and well, a take on an older style, kind of.  The cigar lit might pack a little more punch, who knows.', '2010-03-14 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903948, 859115, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Choice of subject doesn''t interest me and the produced image seems to have no compositional purpose.</td>', '3 - Choice of subject doesn''t interest me and the produced image seems to have no compositional purpose.', '2010-03-14 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903949, 859240, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Potential with a much bolder crop in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Potential with a much bolder crop in my opinion.', '2010-03-14 15:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903951, 858852, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - The horizon... and I also wonder about Challenge misinterpretation.</td>', '3 - The horizon... and I also wonder about Challenge misinterpretation.', '2010-03-14 15:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903953, 858636, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Snapshottish without any real purpose and odd how the effects are mainly on the ''background''...</td>', '2 - Snapshottish without any real purpose and odd how the effects are mainly on the ''background''...', '2010-03-14 15:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903954, 859207, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Potential but the processing/finish doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', '3 - Potential but the processing/finish doesn''t appeal to me.', '2010-03-14 15:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903955, 859174, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Cliche and the background dominates too much.</td>', '3 - Cliche and the background dominates too much.', '2010-03-14 15:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903957, 858943, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Not making a connection with me.</td>', '3 - Not making a connection with me.', '2010-03-14 16:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903958, 858892, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Not my interpretation of the Challenge.</td>', '3 - Not my interpretation of the Challenge.', '2010-03-14 16:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903959, 857856, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - The colors, shape, line and texture don''t hold my interest.</td>', '2 - The colors, shape, line and texture don''t hold my interest.', '2010-03-14 16:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903960, 858350, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Don''t mind the concept, don''t even mind the toning, but the lack of more to explore in the image and the blown sky distract me.</td>', '3 - Don''t mind the concept, don''t even mind the toning, but the lack of more to explore in the image and the blown sky distract me.', '2010-03-14 16:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903961, 859087, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Too cliche for me and your title makes no sense to me.</td>', '2 - Too cliche for me and your title makes no sense to me.', '2010-03-14 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903963, 859156, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Struggling to find purpose in crop/composition with this.  Your border/framing detracts also, in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Struggling to find purpose in crop/composition with this.  Your border/framing detracts also, in my opinion.', '2010-03-14 16:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903965, 858813, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Some might like this, but it''s not doing anything for me.</td>', '2 - Some might like this, but it''s not doing anything for me.', '2010-03-14 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903968, 859206, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Don''t mind the concept, but it is neither blurry nor well defined and lacks quality, in my opinion.  There are some interesting elements here, but your crop doesn''t showcase them well.  Up to 3 from 2.</td>', '3 - Don''t mind the concept, but it is neither blurry nor well defined and lacks quality, in my opinion.  There are some interesting elements here, but your crop doesn''t showcase them well.  Up to 3 from 2.', '2010-03-14 16:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903969, 859219, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Not doing much for me with this straight up, cliche subject and composition, the title needs refinement too.</td>', '2 - Not doing much for me with this straight up, cliche subject and composition, the title needs refinement too.', '2010-03-14 16:08:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5903971, 859079, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Not really finding the art in this (perhaps save for the wings and legs) - the white something is distracting as well.  Up to 3 from 2.</td>', '3 - Not really finding the art in this (perhaps save for the wings and legs) - the white something is distracting as well.  Up to 3 from 2.', '2010-03-14 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903972, 858472, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Doesn''t seem to truly be for the Challenge.</td>', '2 - Doesn''t seem to truly be for the Challenge.', '2010-03-14 16:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903973, 859214, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Possibly potential, with refinement of crop/composition and perhaps exploring the processing more.  Up to 3 from 2.</td>', '3 - Possibly potential, with refinement of crop/composition and perhaps exploring the processing more.  Up to 3 from 2.', '2010-03-14 16:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903974, 858023, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Not doing much for me, especially with the subject choice, focus and processing as is.</td>', '1 - Not doing much for me, especially with the subject choice, focus and processing as is.', '2010-03-14 16:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903975, 858897, 39850, '<td valign="top">1 - Perhaps in years to come, but not right now this isn''t saying ''art'' to me.</td>', '1 - Perhaps in years to come, but not right now this isn''t saying ''art'' to me.', '2010-03-14 16:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903976, 858240, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Wish the bottom was straight.</td>', '5 - Wish the bottom was straight.', '2010-03-14 16:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903977, 859146, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - I like the concept but the composition seems out and a little more pop perhaps, not sure.</td>', '5 - I like the concept but the composition seems out and a little more pop perhaps, not sure.', '2010-03-14 16:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903978, 858967, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Don''t mind the effect, otherwise not doing much for me.</td>', '5 - Don''t mind the effect, otherwise not doing much for me.', '2010-03-14 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903980, 859040, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - I like the concept, but I see more potential in this image.</td>', '5 - I like the concept, but I see more potential in this image.', '2010-03-14 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903981, 859213, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Quite like the effect but wonder about it (the image) pushed much more, somehow.</td>', '5 - Quite like the effect but wonder about it (the image) pushed much more, somehow.', '2010-03-14 16:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903992, 859217, 61961, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower photo, but it doesn''t really bring anything new to the table.  The point of this challenge (at least as I understood it) was to push some boundaries and to aim for a more cutting edge, contemporary feel -- and to reward something other than the usual ribbon-winning landscapes and calendar images.</td>', 'Pretty flower photo, but it doesn''t really bring anything new to the table.  The point of this challenge (at least as I understood it) was to push some boundaries and to aim for a more cutting edge, contemporary feel -- and to reward something other than the usual ribbon-winning landscapes and calendar images.', '2010-03-14 16:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903996, 859177, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think the point of this challenge was to push boundaries and aim for a more contemporary feel -- to avoid the usual calendar images. <br/> <br/>That may not have been clear from the challenge name, though the description pointed to a discussion thread where some of this was hashed out.</td>', 'I think the point of this challenge was to push boundaries and aim for a more contemporary feel -- to avoid the usual calendar images.  That may not have been clear from the challenge name, though the description pointed to a discussion thread where some of this was hashed out.', '2010-03-14 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903998, 858035, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - I guess I''ve seen too many duckies to be moved by this.</td>', '2 - I guess I''ve seen too many duckies to be moved by this.', '2010-03-14 16:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5903999, 858572, 61961, '<td valign="top">My canned response: whatever one''s definition is of fine/contemporary/modern art, I think this entry is too much like business as usual at DPC. In this case: another very pretty flower photo.  Good color and clarity, but a calendar image, which is the opposite of what the challenge called for, at least as I understand it.</td>', 'My canned response: whatever one''s definition is of fine/contemporary/modern art, I think this entry is too much like business as usual at DPC. In this case: another very pretty flower photo.  Good color and clarity, but a calendar image, which is the opposite of what the challenge called for, at least as I understand it.', '2010-03-14 16:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904005, 859025, 61961, '<td valign="top">My canned response: whatever one''s definition is of fine/contemporary/modern art, I think this entry is too much like business as usual at DPC. In this case: another very pretty flower photo. Good color and clarity, but a calendar image, which is the opposite of what the challenge called for, at least as I understand it.</td>', 'My canned response: whatever one''s definition is of fine/contemporary/modern art, I think this entry is too much like business as usual at DPC. In this case: another very pretty flower photo. Good color and clarity, but a calendar image, which is the opposite of what the challenge called for, at least as I understand it.', '2010-03-14 16:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904007, 859209, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Personal preference, I prefer not to look at a tragically sad looking, obvious zoo animal as art (hard to find the right words here), despite that - the feel and capture does first say to me ''zoo shot'' - which it shouldn''t, unless this was your intent (apologies in advance if so).  Having said that, I too have taken zoo shots and tried to ''artify'' them... Maybe it makes a difference if you can''t obviously tell they''re in a cage - unless, as intonated above, that is your intent.</td>', '5 - Personal preference, I prefer not to look at a tragically sad looking, obvious zoo animal as art (hard to find the right words here), despite that - the feel and capture does first say to me ''zoo shot'' - which it shouldn''t, unless this was your intent (apologies in advance if so).  Having said that, I too have taken zoo shots and tried to ''artify'' them... Maybe it makes a difference if you can''t obviously tell they''re in a cage - unless, as intonated above, that is your intent.', '2010-03-14 16:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904008, 859209, 61961, '<td valign="top">As I understood it the challenge was to push boundaries and to aim for a more cutting edge image.  This is pretty tame stuff, though a very good photo that might do well in a Free Study challenge.</td>', 'As I understood it the challenge was to push boundaries and to aim for a more cutting edge image.  This is pretty tame stuff, though a very good photo that might do well in a Free Study challenge.', '2010-03-14 16:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904012, 859131, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the face and I like your title, wish the crop brought it out more.  Up to 7 from 6, I do like this.</td>', '7 - I like the face and I like your title, wish the crop brought it out more.  Up to 7 from 6, I do like this.', '2010-03-14 16:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904014, 859029, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Makes me think of the work of Man Ray.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Makes me think of the work of Man Ray.', '2010-03-14 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904020, 859203, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - A much stronger crop might have brought this to life more, in my opinion anyway.  Up to 5 from 3.</td>', '5 - A much stronger crop might have brought this to life more, in my opinion anyway.  Up to 5 from 3.', '2010-03-14 17:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904021, 859249, 8367, '<td valign="top">I like your style. The colors are very vivid and pop right out at you.<br/>In my humble opinion, this would be classified as digital art.</td>', 'I like your style. The colors are very vivid and pop right out at you.In my humble opinion, this would be classified as digital art.', '2010-03-14 17:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904027, 859096, 61961, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, at least a 9 from me.  Some aspect (color treatment?) reminds me of the photography of Gregory Crewdson.</td>', 'Excellent work, at least a 9 from me.  Some aspect (color treatment?) reminds me of the photography of Gregory Crewdson.', '2010-03-14 17:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904042, 858654, 61961, '<td valign="top">Definitely not business-as-usual on DPC.  I''m sure this will do well; my only criticism (can''t win for trying, can you?) is that it veers into gimmicky territory, so no more than an 8 from me.</td>', 'Definitely not business-as-usual on DPC.  I''m sure this will do well; my only criticism (can''t win for trying, can you?) is that it veers into gimmicky territory, so no more than an 8 from me.', '2010-03-14 17:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904044, 859166, 61961, '<td valign="top">The androgynous aspect is intriguing.  I especially like your crop/composition, with all the space at the bottom.  Nice tones, focus.</td>', 'The androgynous aspect is intriguing.  I especially like your crop/composition, with all the space at the bottom.  Nice tones, focus.', '2010-03-14 17:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904047, 859176, 61961, '<td valign="top">Unusual, I like the tension in the arm and I really like the (honey?) dripping from the - uhm - weed.  The frame/illusion is an okay touch but may be a bit too gimmicky.</td>', 'Unusual, I like the tension in the arm and I really like the (honey?) dripping from the - uhm - weed.  The frame/illusion is an okay touch but may be a bit too gimmicky.', '2010-03-14 17:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904070, 858395, 28427, '<td valign="top">A photograph that speaks - great light, contrast *9*<br/> <br/>Edit: revisited entry to reconsider scoring: up with 1 point.</td>', 'A photograph that speaks - great light, contrast *9* Edit: revisited entry to reconsider scoring: up with 1 point.', '2010-03-14 17:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904072, 859159, 100393, '<td valign="top">Colourful blurry goodness! What is great about this image is the way you''ve got the amount of colour and blurriness absolutely spot on.</td>', 'Colourful blurry goodness! What is great about this image is the way you''ve got the amount of colour and blurriness absolutely spot on.', '2010-03-14 17:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904074, 859221, 100393, '<td valign="top">Not one of the edgier images in the challenge - many people might feel this is a little safe but I like it a lot so it got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Not one of the edgier images in the challenge - many people might feel this is a little safe but I like it a lot so it got a 7 from me.', '2010-03-14 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904078, 859225, 554, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>Yep, still my #1 pick of the 188 images.  I hope you do well .  There is some tough competition.</td>', '#1Yep, still my #1 pick of the 188 images.  I hope you do well .  There is some tough competition.', '2010-03-14 17:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904079, 859035, 100393, '<td valign="top">An image of contrasts: saturated / desaturated; sharp/ blurry; foreground / background - nothing in between. Well made, I like it (scored a 7 earlier, back to comment).</td>', 'An image of contrasts: saturated / desaturated; sharp/ blurry; foreground / background - nothing in between. Well made, I like it (scored a 7 earlier, back to comment).', '2010-03-14 17:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904081, 858833, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great POV, love the motion blur, the texture and the starburst lighting. I''m less keen on the coloration - but that''s just a personal foible.</td>', 'Great POV, love the motion blur, the texture and the starburst lighting. I''m less keen on the coloration - but that''s just a personal foible.', '2010-03-14 17:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904086, 859171, 100393, '<td valign="top">Although this is largely about existing artwork it would be wrong to see this as a derivative image - your photography has brought plenty of added value here: the POV and the position of the sun in the frame, the full on coloration and then all the technical stuff relating to the contra-jour technique. All good stuff. I also like the way the distortions in the ''petals'' are mirrored by the lens distortion of the whole image.</td>', 'Although this is largely about existing artwork it would be wrong to see this as a derivative image - your photography has brought plenty of added value here: the POV and the position of the sun in the frame, the full on coloration and then all the technical stuff relating to the contra-jour technique. All good stuff. I also like the way the distortions in the ''petals'' are mirrored by the lens distortion of the whole image.', '2010-03-14 17:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904087, 857967, 100393, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract - distinguished by the quality of the execution. The colours are superbly restrained.</td>', 'Interesting abstract - distinguished by the quality of the execution. The colours are superbly restrained.', '2010-03-14 17:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904088, 859081, 100393, '<td valign="top">Nice image - I like the way this communicated two distinct planes so very well and how the image plays with the mind''s perception of horizontal and vertical at the back on the scene. I think it could have stood a touch more contrast.</td>', 'Nice image - I like the way this communicated two distinct planes so very well and how the image plays with the mind''s perception of horizontal and vertical at the back on the scene. I think it could have stood a touch more contrast.', '2010-03-14 17:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904090, 859228, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great contrived / created image - superbly executed. Two things hold me back scoring this higher than the 7 I gave earlier: The image offers excellent depth but the rather flat light on the subject doesn''t allow the eye to be drawn in; and (this may be a failing in me) I can''t really discern a story from the scene. Of course these reactions may have been among those you wanted from a viewer.<br/> <br/>Clearly very good work though.</td>', 'Great contrived / created image - superbly executed. Two things hold me back scoring this higher than the 7 I gave earlier: The image offers excellent depth but the rather flat light on the subject doesn''t allow the eye to be drawn in; and (this may be a failing in me) I can''t really discern a story from the scene. Of course these reactions may have been among those you wanted from a viewer. Clearly very good work though.', '2010-03-14 17:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904091, 859145, 100393, '<td valign="top">Highly interesting image - bang on brief. Great coloration and superbly dynamic too.</td>', 'Highly interesting image - bang on brief. Great coloration and superbly dynamic too.', '2010-03-14 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904092, 859100, 100393, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of this genre of work - well executed, with superb coloration.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of this genre of work - well executed, with superb coloration.', '2010-03-14 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
