(5904251, 859211, 76335, '<td valign="top">The grain is too staticky, too noisy, too digital. I struggle with this. There may well come a day that digital noise matches film grain in terms of its artistic value. I like the composition here so much, though, that I have to throw lots of points your way.</td>', 'The grain is too staticky, too noisy, too digital. I struggle with this. There may well come a day that digital noise matches film grain in terms of its artistic value. I like the composition here so much, though, that I have to throw lots of points your way.', '2010-03-14 20:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904252, 858897, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is wrong on so many levels. The pose is unnatural and forced, and the contrast is flat. But all this strengthens the deadpan feel of the whole thing -- and it makes me smile. Eight points for you.</td>', 'This is wrong on so many levels. The pose is unnatural and forced, and the contrast is flat. But all this strengthens the deadpan feel of the whole thing -- and it makes me smile. Eight points for you.', '2010-03-14 20:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
