(5904379, 858744, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like that I can''t figure out if it''s a wing or a leaf.  The subject is appealing - As far a focal quality, I''e like a bit more sharpness. 7</td>', 'I like that I can''t figure out if it''s a wing or a leaf.  The subject is appealing - As far a focal quality, I''e like a bit more sharpness. 7', '2010-03-14 21:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904380, 859027, 67697, '<td valign="top">Quite thought-provoking.  My MIL is also on a tank and I have to say, he looks healthier than she does.  All the best to him.</td>', 'Quite thought-provoking.  My MIL is also on a tank and I have to say, he looks healthier than she does.  All the best to him.', '2010-03-14 21:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904381, 859183, 38032, '<td valign="top">Like a piece of a dream.</td>', 'Like a piece of a dream.', '2010-03-14 21:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904385, 858236, 67697, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this is a sculpture or not but I do find it quite intriguing.  Your use of light and colortone really does a nice job of enhancing the drama.  I hope to read more about what this is after the challenge!</td>', 'I can''t tell if this is a sculpture or not but I do find it quite intriguing.  Your use of light and colortone really does a nice job of enhancing the drama.  I hope to read more about what this is after the challenge!', '2010-03-14 22:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904389, 858940, 67697, '<td valign="top">Interesting - this is more like a zen shot.  Love the grain (as in noise not the rice lol)</td>', 'Interesting - this is more like a zen shot.  Love the grain (as in noise not the rice lol)', '2010-03-14 22:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904390, 858551, 38032, '<td valign="top">This one jumps out at me - the color reminds me of great film photography and the subject is really intriguing and overall meets the challenge very well.  Strong comp, great contrast, fun, intriguing subject. <br/> <br/>The vignette seems over the top in post processing but overall a really strong piece. 7</td>', 'This one jumps out at me - the color reminds me of great film photography and the subject is really intriguing and overall meets the challenge very well.  Strong comp, great contrast, fun, intriguing subject.  The vignette seems over the top in post processing but overall a really strong piece. 7', '2010-03-14 22:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904391, 859212, 25355, '<td valign="top">Water going down a drain, but it''s hard to tell what it is, really. It''s more like a surreal photorealistic painting than a photo. What is she holding?</td>', 'Water going down a drain, but it''s hard to tell what it is, really. It''s more like a surreal photorealistic painting than a photo. What is she holding?', '2010-03-14 22:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904395, 858694, 25355, '<td valign="top">My guess is that it''s a (Japanese) umbrella being spun.</td>', 'My guess is that it''s a (Japanese) umbrella being spun.', '2010-03-14 22:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904397, 858912, 38032, '<td valign="top">the eye likes to travel on this one.  An appealing subject with some mystery as well. Personally, it''s not what I would expect in a contemporary or modern gallery, but it does have a lot going for it.</td>', 'the eye likes to travel on this one.  An appealing subject with some mystery as well. Personally, it''s not what I would expect in a contemporary or modern gallery, but it does have a lot going for it.', '2010-03-14 22:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904398, 859143, 38032, '<td valign="top">nice painterly feel.  The bardges? in the distance  - I can''t decide if they add anxiety or distract.  A strong piece though with nice tones.</td>', 'nice painterly feel.  The bardges? in the distance  - I can''t decide if they add anxiety or distract.  A strong piece though with nice tones.', '2010-03-14 22:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904399, 858538, 38032, '<td valign="top">My eye can''t decide where to go which is kinda fun ... I like the subject but I think the border distracts from the subject/s</td>', 'My eye can''t decide where to go which is kinda fun ... I like the subject but I think the border distracts from the subject/s', '2010-03-14 22:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
