(5904584, 858234, 52336, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful... excellent composition and interesting use of what appears to be inversion, but what strikes me is way we are forced to decipher what this is... the suggestion in this photo is well crafted, carried by the beautiful focus, the b/w, the vignette... wonderful photograph, worthy of a win.  Thank you.</td>', 'Quite beautiful... excellent composition and interesting use of what appears to be inversion, but what strikes me is way we are forced to decipher what this is... the suggestion in this photo is well crafted, carried by the beautiful focus, the b/w, the vignette... wonderful photograph, worthy of a win.  Thank you.', '2010-03-14 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904586, 858793, 52336, '<td valign="top">Lovely and suggestive... the tones and b/w are perfect, the mystery of this photographic, as prosaic as the subject may seem, is haunting... a lovely photo, thanks.</td>', 'Lovely and suggestive... the tones and b/w are perfect, the mystery of this photographic, as prosaic as the subject may seem, is haunting... a lovely photo, thanks.', '2010-03-14 23:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5904589, 859022, 52336, '<td valign="top">Excellent... prefect use of the technicals (b/w, grain, vignette), and the elements of the story are merely suggested by the subject, which is masterful... wonderfully balanced, perfectly thought about.  Thanks!</td>', 'Excellent... prefect use of the technicals (b/w, grain, vignette), and the elements of the story are merely suggested by the subject, which is masterful... wonderfully balanced, perfectly thought about.  Thanks!', '2010-03-14 23:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
