(5904668, 859027, 61818, '<td valign="top">What a crock.  I entered a snapshot of part of a fishtank and it placed pages ahead of this.  <br/> <br/>You used photography to write a visual essay which touches on a number of contemporary topics while still appealing on an aesthetic level and I have to browse back 6 pages to find it.  <br/> <br/>If your goal is to be successful in this medium, you are a long way towards accomplishing it.<br/> <br/>Disappearing back into the ether now.  Really enjoyed this piece.<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'What a crock.  I entered a snapshot of part of a fishtank and it placed pages ahead of this.   You used photography to write a visual essay which touches on a number of contemporary topics while still appealing on an aesthetic level and I have to browse back 6 pages to find it.   If your goal is to be successful in this medium, you are a long way towards accomplishing it. Disappearing back into the ether now.  Really enjoyed this piece. Good luck!', '2010-03-15 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5904670, 859145, 115096, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments everyone!<br/> <br/>@ ancientimages: No probelm :)   I focused on the rose hips in the background and brought my hand in close to the camera. The bleeding edge around the fingers was there in the exposure from being out-of-focus but I also brought up the definition and contrast which helped bring out the glassy look.<br/> <br/>@ EstimatedEyes: There is no intended religious association with the rose hips on the palms, purely artistic.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-15 04:11:50.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments everyone! @ ancientimages: No probelm :)   I focused on the rose hips in the background and brought my hand in close to the camera. The bleeding edge around the fingers was there in the exposure from being out-of-focus but I also brought up the definition and contrast which helped bring out the glassy look. @ EstimatedEyes: There is no intended religious association with the rose hips on the palms, purely artistic.', '2010-03-15 00:14:12.000000', '2010-03-15 04:11:50.000000', 0),
