(5904954, 859114, 72134, '<td valign="top">Great, thanks. This one is a little middle of another photo hanging on my wall. I just had nothing so I took picture of myn photo from 2004. All these colors are living algae, also the white, in hot spring area in the highland, they live there under the meters thick snow all the winter, there are also flies and spiders living there in the snowcaves and the colors are amazing. Thanks for your votes, I did''nt exspect much.</td>', 'Great, thanks. This one is a little middle of another photo hanging on my wall. I just had nothing so I took picture of myn photo from 2004. All these colors are living algae, also the white, in hot spring area in the highland, they live there under the meters thick snow all the winter, there are also flies and spiders living there in the snowcaves and the colors are amazing. Thanks for your votes, I did''nt exspect much.', '2010-03-15 06:09:56.000000', NULL, 0),
