(7221840, 859189, 152252, '<td valign="top">Oh man, the first person I thought about when I saw this was Ken, and him calling me a right-brained lunatic, and repeating that he is Art, not artsy. Lol, then I read this:  <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> LOL - I love the whole story here, Jason. You did what I would''ve done - something random and pretentious. Still, you applied some constraints to it that kept our resident fine art critics from picking it out of the crowd. They were on to you.<br/></i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Oh man, the first person I thought about when I saw this was Ken, and him calling me a right-brained lunatic, and repeating that he is Art, not artsy. Lol, then I read this:   Originally posted by Art Roflmao: LOL - I love the whole story here, Jason. You did what I would''ve done - something random and pretentious. Still, you applied some constraints to it that kept our resident fine art critics from picking it out of the crowd. They were on to you.', '2014-05-28 21:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
